  <para style="h">Abacamanza</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’Abacamanza</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abacamanza</para>
  <para style="toc3">Abc</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu</para>
  <para style="mt1">c’Abacamanza</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bagwanya Abanyakanani basigaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Yosuwa amaze gupfa, Abisirayeli babaza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bati: “Ni uwuhe muryango uzotangura kuduga gutera Abanyakanani?”<verse eid="JDG 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arabishura ati: “Umuryango wa Yuda uzobe ari wo ugenda ubwa mbere, kuko ndabahaye intsinzi kuri iyo ntara.”<verse eid="JDG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Abo mu muryango wa Yuda babarira abo mu muryango wa Simeyoni bati: “Nimuze tudugane mu ntara twahawe, tugwanye Abanyakanani. Natwe tuzoheza tubafashe gufata intara yanyu.” Nuko abo mu muryango wa Simeyoni bajana na bo.<verse eid="JDG 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Abo mu muryango wa Yuda bateye, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abaha intsinzi ku Banyakanani n’Abaperizi, bicamwo abasoda ibihumbi cumi muri bo mu gisagara ca Bezeki. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Aho ni ho basanze umwami Adoni-Bezeki, bamugwanirizaho, bahaneshereza Abanyakanani n’Abaperizi. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Adoni-Bezeki arahunga, ariko baramukurikira baramufata, bamuca intoke z’inkumu n’amano makuru.<verse eid="JDG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Maze Adoni-Bezeki aravuga ati: “Igihe kimwe nafashe abami mirongo indwi, bacibwa inkumu n’amano makuru, bakarya ibikorotse ku meza yanje. None Imana inyishuye ivyo nabakoreye.” Baca bamutwara i Yerusalemu apfirayo.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Abo mu muryango wa Yuda bongera batera Yerusalemu, barahafata. Bicisha inkota abahaba, baca barahaturira.<verse eid="JDG 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Hanyuma y’aho abo mu muryango wa Yuda baca bamanuka gutera Abanyakanani baba mu karere k’imisozi, i Negebu, no mu biyaya vyo mu ntango z’imisozi yo mu burengero. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Barabandanya batera Abanyakanani baba i Heburoni, ahahoze hitwa Kiriyati-Araba, banesha ab’i Sheshayi, Ahimani n’i Talumayi. <verse eid="JDG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Bavuye aho baca barabandanya baja gutera abantu baba i Debiri, ahahora hitwa Kiriyati-Seferi.<verse eid="JDG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Maze Kalebu aravuga ati: “Uwuzotera i Kiriyati-Seferi akahafata, nzomuha umukobwa wanje Akisa abe umugore wiwe.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Otiniyeli mwene Kenazi, murumuna wa Kalebu arahafata; Kalebu aca amushingira umukobwa wiwe Akisa.<verse eid="JDG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Akisa amaze kuba umugore wa Otiniyeli, aca amubwira ngo asabe se itongo. Akisa yururutse indogoba yiwe, Kalebu aramubaza ati: “Wipfuza iki?”<verse eid="JDG 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Akisa amwishura ati: “Ngirira ubuntu. Ko wampaye itongo i Negebu, mpa n’amariba y’amazi.” Nuko Kalebu amuha amariba yo hepfo n’ayo haruguru.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Abakomoka kuri sebukwe wa Mose, ari bo Bakayini, badugana n’abo mu muryango wa Yuda bava i Yeriko, ari co gisagara c’ibigazi, babana n’ababa mu bugaragwa bw’i Buyuda, hafi y’igisagara ca Aradi i Negebu.<verse eid="JDG 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Hanyuma abo mu muryango wa Yuda bifatanya n’abo mu muryango wa Simeyoni, batera Abanyakanani baba i Zefati, basambura igisagara cabo cose. Ico gisagara baca bacita Horuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Abo mu muryango wa Yuda bongera bafata Gaza, Ashikeloni na Ekuroni, hamwe n’uturere tuhakikuje.<verse eid="JDG 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abana n’abo mu muryango wa Yuda, maze bafata igice co mu misozi, ariko ntibashobora kwirukana ababa mu biyaya, kuko bari bafise imikogote y’ivyuma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Igisagara ca Heburoni gihabwa Kalebu nk’uko Mose yari yarabisezeranye, Kalebu na we aca yirukana abahaba, ari bo ruvyaro rw’abahungu batatu ba Anaki. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Ariko abo mu muryango wa Benyamini ntibashobora kwirukana Abayebusi baba i Yerusalemu, ari co gituma gushika n’ubu Abayebusi babana n’abo mu muryango wa Benyamini.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Imiryango ikomoka kuri Yosefu na yo itera igisagara ca Beteli, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abana na bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Nuko barungika abantu baja gutata igisagara ca Beteli, cahoze citwa Luzi. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Abo batasi babonye umuntu ava muri ico gisagara, baramubwira bati: “Twereke ingene twokwinjira muri iki gisagara, tuzokugirira neza.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Nuko aca arabereka, baca barinjira bicisha inkota abo muri ico gisagara bose, kiretse uwo yaberetse ingene boshika muri ico gisagara hamwe n’umuryango wiwe. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Maze uwo muntu aca aja mu ntara y’Abaheti, ahubaka igisagara, acita Luzi, kandi ni ko kicitwa gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Umuryango wa Manase na wo ntiwashoboye kwirukana abantu b’i Beti-Shani, canke ab’i Tanaki, canke ab’i Dori, canke ab’i Ibileyamu, canke ab’i Megido, canke abari bahakikuje, kuko Abanyakanani bari barahiye ko bazoguma baba muri iyo ntara. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Abisirayeli bamaze gukomera, baca bagira Abanyakanani abagurano, ariko ntibigeze babirukana bose muri iyo ntara. <verse eid="JDG 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />N’abo mu muryango wa Efurayimu ntibashoboye kwirukana Abanyakanani baba i Gezeri, bagumye babana na bo. <verse eid="JDG 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Ndetse n’abo mu muryango wa Zebuloni na bo nyene ntibashoboye kwirukana Abanyakanani baba i Kitironi n’i Nahaloli, bagumye babana na bo, ariko ntibabagize abagurano. <verse eid="JDG 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />N’abo mu muryango wa Asheri ntibashoboye kwirukana ababa muri Ako, canke ab’i Sidoni, canke ab’i Ahalabu, canke abo muri Akizibu, canke ab’i Helubaho canke abo muri Afiki, canke ab’i Rehobu. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Ahubwo abo mu muryango wa Asheri bagiye kubana n’Abanyakanani baganza iyo ntara, kuko bananiwe kubirukana. <verse eid="JDG 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Abo mu muryango wa Nafutali na bo nyene ntibashoboye kwirukana ababa i Beti-Shemeshi canke i Beti-Anati. Na bo nyene babanye n’Abanyakanani baba muri iyo ntara, ariko ababa i Beti-Shemeshi n’i Beti-Anati babagira abagurano babo. <verse eid="JDG 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Abo mu muryango wa Dani, Abamori barabirukanye baja mu karere k’imisozi, ntibabemerera ko bamanuka mu biyaya. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Abamori bari bararahiye ko bazoguma ku misozi Hari-Haresi, Ayaloni na Shayalubimu, ariko abo mu muryango wa Yosefu bamaze kugwira, baciye babagira abagurano. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Urubibe rw’Abamori rwava ku mudugo wa Akurabimu rugashika i Sela, rukabandanya ruja ruguru.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Bokimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aduga ava i Gilugali aja i Bokimu, avuga ati: “Nabaduganye ndabakuye muri Egiputa ndabashikana mu gihugu narahiye ko nzoha ba sogokuruza banyu. Naravuze ko ntazorenga kw’isezerano nagiranye na bo. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Ku ruhande rwanyu mwemeye ko mutazogirana isezerano na rimwe n’ababa muri iki gihugu, mwemera ko muzosangangura ibicaniro vyabo. Ariko ntimwanyumviye. Mbega ivyo mwabitumwe n’iki? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />None rero ndababwiye ko ntazobirukana imbere yanyu. Bazobabera nk’amahwa abacumita mu mbavu, imana zabo na zo zibabere imitego.”<verse eid="JDG 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Uwo mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaze kubwira Abisirayeli bose ivyo, abantu baraturikisha bararira. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Aho hantu baca bahita Bokimu, bisigura “Kurira”, baca bahashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kutumvira no kuneshwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Yosuwa amaze kurungika Abisirayeli, baciye baja gufata igihugu, umuryango wose uja gufata aho wahawe. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Abantu bakorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mu gihe cose Yosuwa yari akiriho no mu gihe c’abatware bakoranye na we, abo yasize amaze gupfa, abari barabonye ibikomeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yarakoreye Isirayeli.<verse eid="JDG 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yosuwa mwene Nuni, umusavyi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, apfa amaze imyaka ijana na cumi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Bamuhamba mw’itongo yagabanye i Timunati-Hereki, mu ntara yo mu misozi ya Efurayimu, mu buraruko bw’umusozi Gayashi.<verse eid="JDG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Urwo runganwe rumaze guhamvya ba sekuruza, haza urundi rutari rwarigeze rumenya <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> canke ngo rubone ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yakoreye Isirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Nuko Abisirayeli bakora ibibi mu maso y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bongera bakorera ibigirwamana vyitwa Bayali. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Bava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya ba sekuruza babo, yabakuye muri Egiputa, bakurikira imana zitandukanye z’abantu babana na bo, barazisenga. Ivyo bituma uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buziriringa, <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />kuko bari bayivuyeko bagakorera ibigirwamana Bayali na Ashitaroti. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Ivyo bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakira Isirayeli, abarekuriramwo abasuma babanyaga ivyabo. Abagurisha ku bansi babo bari babakikuje kuko batari bagishoboye kubagwanya. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Igihe cose Abisirayeli baja kugwana, ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwarabagwanya bakaneshwa nk’uko yari yarabisezeranye. Nuko baja mu kwihebura gukomeye.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahagurutsa abacamanza, barokora Abisirayeli mu maboko y’abari barabanyaze. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Ariko Abisirayeli ntibumvira abo bacamanza, ahubwo bashira imitima ku zindi mana, barazisenga. Nuko bihutira kuva mu nzira za ba sekuruza kuko bobo bagendera mu kwumvira ivyagezwe vy’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Igihe cose <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabahagurukiriza umucamanza, yabana na we akabarokora mu maboko y’abansi babo igihe cose uwo mucamanza yaba akiriho, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaterwa akagongwe n’amaborogo avuye ku gacinyizo bagirirwa n’abansi babo. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Ariko uwo mucamanza amaze gupfa, abantu baca basubira gukora ibibi biruta n’ivya ba sekuruza, bagakurikira izindi mana, bakazikorera bakongera bakazisenga. Banka guheba ibikorwa vyabo bibi n’ubugarariji bwabo.<verse eid="JDG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Ni co catumye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arakira Isirayeli cane, avuga ati: “Ko ubu bwoko bwarenze isezerano nagiranye na ba sekuruza babo, bakanka gukurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />nta hanga na rimwe Yosuwa yapfuye atanesheje nzokwirukana imbere yabo. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Nzokoresha ayo mahanga mu kugerageza Abisirayeli kugira ngo ndabe ko boguma mu nzira z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bakagenda nk’uko ba sekuruza bagenda.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yaretse ayo mahanga akagumaho, ntiyigera ayirukana canke ngo yemere ko Yosuwa ayamara yose.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Aya ni yo mahanga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yasigaje kugira ngo agerageze Abisirayeli batagwanye intambara n’imwe mu zabereye i Kanani. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Ayo yayasigaje kugira ngo yigishe intambara uruvyaro rwa Isirayeli rutigeze ruja mu ntambara. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Ayo mahanga na yo ni aya: Abafilisitiya bari barongowe n’abatware batanu, Abanyakanani bose, Abanyesidoni hamwe n’Abahiwi baba mu misozi ya Libani kuva ku musozi Bayali-Herumoni gushika i Lebo-Hamati. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Ayo mahanga yasigajwe ngo agerageze Isirayeli, kugira ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arabe ko bazokurikiza amabwirizwa yahaye ba sekuruza aciye kuri Mose.<verse eid="JDG 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Abisirayeli babana n’Abanyakanani, Abaheti, Abamori, Abaperizi, Abahiwi n’Abayebusi, <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />bahana abageni, bongera bakorera imana zabo.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otiniyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Abisirayeli bakora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu maso yiwe, bibagira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, bakorera Bayali na Ashera. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buziriringira Isirayeli, abatanga ku mwami Kushani Rishatayimu w’i Mezopotamiya, bamubera abagurano imyaka umunani. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Hanyuma baririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo abatabare, na we abahagurukiriza uwubacungura, ari we Otiniyeli mwene Kenazi, Kenazi murumuna wa Kalebu, maze arabarokora. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuri we, aba umucamanza w’Abisirayeli. Atera umwami Kushani Rishatayimu wa Aramu, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amurekurira mu maboko ya Otiniyeli, aramunesha. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Igihugu gica kimara imyaka mirongo ine kiri mu mahoro, gushika Otiniyeli mwene Kenazi apfuye.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Abisirayeli bongera gukora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu maso yiwe, bituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha umwami Eguloni w’i Mowabu ububasha bwo kuganza Isirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Eguloni akoranya Abamoni n’Abamaleki ngo bamufashe kugwanya Abisirayeli. Nuko barabatera barabanesha, bafata Yeriko, ari co gisagara c’ibigazi. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Abisirayeli bakorera Eguloni umwami w’i Mowabu imyaka icumi n’umunani.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Abisirayeli basubira kuririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo abatabare, na we abahagurukiriza uwundi mucunguzi, ari we Ehudi mwene Gera, yakoresha ibampfu akaba uwo mu muryango wa Benyamini. Abisirayeli bamurungikana ikori kuri Eguloni umwami wa Mowabu. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ehudi yari yaracuze inkota y’ubugi bubiri yangana n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 45.</char></note>, ayibohera kw’itako ry’i buryo, ayambarirako. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Nuko ashikanira iryo kori Eguloni umwami wa Mowabu, kandi yari avyibushe cane. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehudi ahejeje kurimuha, we n’abari baje barizanye baca basubira inyuma. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Bashitse i Gilugali aho basengera ibigirwamana vy’ibuye, aca asubira inyuma, abwira umwami ati: “Nyenicubahiro, ndafise ubutumwa bw’ibanga ndakuzaniye.” Umwami na we aca abwira abatware biwe bose ati: “Nimudutaramukire tubonane.”<verse eid="JDG 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Nuko Ehudi aramwegera aho yari yicaye wenyene mu cumba co hejuru mu kirimba, amubwira ati: “Ndagufitiye ubutumwa buvuye ku Mana.” Wa mwami aca arahaguruka aho yari yicaye, <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ehudi na we aramvura ukuboko kwiwe kw’ukubamfu afata ya nkota yari iboheye kw’itako ry’i buryo, ayisogota mu nda y’uwo mwami. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />N’ikirindi cayo kirinjira, iserukira mu mugongo. Ehudi ntiyayisokora, ibinure vyiwe birayipfuka. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Ehudi aca asiga yugariye imbere umuryango w’ico cumba, na we asohokana mu bwiherero.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Amaze kugenda, abakozi b’uwo mwami baraza basanga umuryango w’ico cumba wugariye imbere. Ni ko kwibaza ko umwami yoba yari ari kwihagarika. <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Nuko bararindira, ariko bashika aho bagira amakenga babonye umwami atugurura.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Bakirindiriye, Ehudi afata inzira arigira. Aca i ruhande ya ca kibanza basengeramwo ibigirwamana, aja i Seyira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Ashitseyo mu ntara y’imisozi ya Efurayimu, aca avuza inzamba y’intambara. Abisirayeli baca bamanukana na we, aba ari we abarongora.<verse eid="JDG 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Ababwira ati: “Nimunkurikire, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarekuriye mu maboko yanyu umwansi wanyu ari we Mowabu.” Nuko baramukurikira, baramanuka, bafata amajabukiro yose yo kuri Yorodani ava i Mowabu, kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe ajabuka. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Nuko batera Mowabu, bica abantu ibihumbi cumi mu basoda bakomeye kandi b’inguvu, ntihagira n’umwe acika kw’icumu. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Uwo musi nyene Mowabu gihinduka intara yigaruriwe na Isirayeli, igihugu cose gica kimara imyaka mirongo umunani kiri mu mahoro.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shamugari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Inyuma ya Ehudi haje Shamugari mwene Anati, ari na we yishe Abafilisitiya amajana atandatu abicishije igisonga. Nuko na we yabaye umutabazi w’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s1">Debora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehudi amaze gupfa Abisirayeli bongera gukora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu maso yiwe. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarekurira mu maboko ya Yabini, umwami wa Kanani yaba i Hazori. Sisera ni we yari arongoye ingabo ziwe, na we akaba yaba i Harosheti-Hagoyimu. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Sisera yari afise imikogote amajana icenda kandi yatwaje umukazo Abisirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri. Maze Abisirayeli baririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo abatabare.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Hariho umugore yitwa Debora, umugore wa Lapidoti, yari umuvugishwa kandi ni we yari umucamanza w’Abisirayeli ico gihe. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Yacira imanza musi y’ikigazi ca Debora hagati ya Rama na Beteli mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu, Abisirayeli bakama baza aho ari ngo abatunganirize iyo bafise amatati. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Umusi umwe atumako Baraki mwene Abinowamu yaba i Kedeshi mu ntara ya Nafutali, amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli akubwiye ati: ‘Genda wegeranye abasoda ibihumbi cumi bo mu ba Nafutali no mu ba Zebuloni, ubatware ku musozi Tabori. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Nanje nzokwega Sisera, umukuru w’ingabo za Yabini, hamwe n’imikogote yiwe n’abasoda biwe, baze ku ruzi Kishoni. Aho ni ho nzomurekurira mu maboko yawe.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Baraki aramwishura ati: “Nitwajana nzogenda, ariko nitutajana sinzogenda.”<verse eid="JDG 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debora amwishura ati: “Nta co tuzojana. Ariko tujanye, nta cubahiro bizoguha kuko intsinzi y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuri Sisera izoba ishizwe mu maboko y’umugore.” Nuko Debora ajana na Baraki i Kedeshi. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Bashitseyo, Baraki akoranya imiryango ya Zebuloni na Nafutali. Abasoda ibihumbi cumi baramukurikira, na Debora ajana na we.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Hariho umuntu yitwa Heberi w’Umukayini yari yaravuye mu bandi Bakayini bo mu ruvyaro rwa Hobabu, muramu wa Mose, ashinga ihema ryiwe hafi y’igiti kinini c’i Zayananimu hafi y’i Kedeshi.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Sisera yumvise ko Baraki mwene Abinowamu yaduze ku musozi Tabori, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />aca yegeranya imikogote yiwe yose amajana icenda hamwe n’abagwanyi biwe, baca bafata urugendo bava i Harosheti-Hagoyimu baja ku ruzi Kishoni.<verse eid="JDG 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Maze Debora abwira Baraki ati: “Itegure! Uyu ni wo musi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarekuriye Sisera mu maboko yawe, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agendera imbere yawe.” Nuko Baraki ajana abasoda biwe ibihumbi cumi, bamanuka umutumba Tabori baja kugwana. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Baraki ateye Sisera, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na we amuca ivutu hamwe n’imikogote yiwe n’abagwanyi biwe bose, Sisera aca ava mu mukogote ahunga yiruka n’amaguru.<verse eid="JDG 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Ariko Baraki akurikira iyo mikogote n’abo basoda gushika i Harosheti-Hagoyimu. Abasoda ba Sisera bose bamarwa n’inkota, ntihasigara n’uwo kuvuga inkuru. <verse eid="JDG 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Ariko Sisera we ahunga yiruka n’amaguru, ashikira ihema rya Yayeli muka Heberi Umukayini, kuko uwo muryango wari ufitaniye ubucuti na Yabini umwami wa Hazori.<verse eid="JDG 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yayeli asohoka gusanganira Sisera, amubwira ati: “Kaze nyakwubahwa. Kandi ntihagire ico utinya.” Nuko aca yinjira muri iryo hema, Yayeli amupfuka uburengeti.<verse eid="JDG 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Sisera amubwira ati: “Ndanyotewe. Impa amazi yo kunywa.” Aca amuha umukuza warimwo amata, aranywa, aca arasubira aramupfuka.<verse eid="JDG 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Sisera amubwira ati: “Hagarara mu muryango w’ihema, nihagira uwuza akakubaza ati: ‘Hari umuntu yinjiye ngaha?’ Uvuge uti: ‘Oya.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Ariko Yayeli muka Heberi aca ahitana urumambo rw’ihema n’inyundo, yinjira bukebuke, yinjira aho Sisera yari aryamye asinziriye cane kuko yari yarushe. Aca amushinga rwa rumambo rw’ihema mu mutwe, ararushimangira gushika hasi, Sisera aca arapfa.<verse eid="JDG 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Baraki ashitse ariko arakurikira Sisera, Yayeli aramutegera, amubwira ati: “Ingo ndakwereke uwo uriko urarondera.” Aca yinjirana na we aho Sisera yari aryamye, na rwa rumambo rw’ihema rushinze mu mutwe, yapfuye.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Uwo musi Imana inesha Yabini umwami w’Umunyakanani, imbere y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Kuva ico gihe, Abisirayeli basumvya inkomezi Yabini umwami w’Umunyakanani, gushika aho bamurandura.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo ya Debora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Uwo musi Debora na Baraki mwene Abinowamu baca bariririmba indirimbo bavuga bati:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />“Nimuhimbaze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">kuko habonetse intwari zirongora Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:2">abantu bakitanga batagoberewe.<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Nimwumve yemwe bami, mutege amatwi namwe batware!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">Ngira ndirimbire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:3">ncurarangire <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, igihe wava i Seyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">ukagendagenda uvuye mu ntara ya Edomu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">isi yaratigise, ijuru rirajojota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:4">ibicu bisesa amazi.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />Imitumba yanyiganyigiye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Imana y’i Sinayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:5">imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli ni ho yatigitiye.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Mu gihe ca Shamugari mwene Anati, no mu gihe ca Yayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">abantu ntibari bagica mu mabarabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:6">n’ingenzi zaca mu tuyira dutoduto duca kure.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Abo mu bisagara vya Isirayeli ntibashobora kugwana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">gushika aho jewe Debora mpagurukiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:7">mpaguruka nk’umuvyeyi wa Isirayeli.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Igihe bihitiramwo izindi mana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">intambara yinjiye mu marembo y’igisagara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">nta nkinzo canke icumu ryaboneka mu Bisirayeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:8">mu bihumbi mirongo ine vy’ingabo.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Umutima wanje uri kumwe n’abarongozi ba Isirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">n’abitanze bo mu bwoko ngo baje mu ntambara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:9">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nashimwe!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Yemwe abagendera ku ndogoba z’igitare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">na mwebwe mwiyicariye ku mikeka myiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:10">namwe mugendera mu mabarabara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">nimutege amatwi <verse eid="JDG 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />indirimbo z’abungere bari ku ngomero.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">Bavuga intsinzi ziva ku kugororoka kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">hamwe n’intsinzi y’Abisirayeli.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Maze abantu baca baramanuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:11">baja ku marembo y’ibisagara.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Kanguka, kanguka Debora!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Kanguka, shirako uririmbe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Kanguka, yewe Baraki!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:12">Gira imbohe abanyagano bawe, yewe mwene Abinowamu!<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Amasigarira y’abubahwa baramanutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:13">ubwoko bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwaje aho ndi ngo buhangane n’abanyenkomezi.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Bamwe baje bava mu ba Efurayimu, abatsinze Amaleki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">Ababenyamini bari kumwe nawe bagukurikiye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">Abakuru mu basoda bamanutse bava i Makiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:14">abatanga amategeko na bo bamanutse bava mu Bazebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Abaganwa ba Isakari na bo bari kumwe na Debora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">ni ivy’ukuri aba Isakari bari kumwe na Baraki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">barungikwa mu biyaya barongowe na we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Mu karere ka Reyubeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:15">vyaranse ko bafata ingingo baguma mu mpari.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Ni kuki mwigumiye mu mpongore z’intama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">ngo mwumvirize urwamo rw’imikuku?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Mu bakomoka kuri Reyubeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:16">Vyaranse ko bafata ingingo.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Ab’i Gileyadi bigumiye hakurya ya Yorodani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">Kandi ni kuki abakomoka kuri Dani, bigumiye mu mato yabo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Abakomoka kuri Asheri bagumye bicaye ku nkengera z’ikiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:17">bisigarira mu bivuko vyabo.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Abakomoka kuri Zebuloni bashize ubuzima bwabo mw’irinde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:18">n’abakomoka kuri Nafutali na bo bahangana n’urugamba mu misozi.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Abami baraje baragwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">abami b’i Kanani baragwanye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">I Tanaki, hafi y’amazi y’i Megido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:19">nta feza bashoboye kunyaga.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru zaragwanye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:20">zajanye inzira zazo zigwanya Sisera.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Uruzi Kishoni rwarabatwaye bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">uruzi rwa kera cane, uruzi Kishoni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">Komera, mushaha wanje, gira inkomezi!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Hanyuma humvikanye urwamo rw’ibinono vy’amafarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:22">zigenda zirasimbagurika ku binono vyazo vy’inkomezi.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: ‘Vuma Merozi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">N’abantu baho bavumwe bikomeye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">kuko bataje gufasha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:23">gufasha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugwanya abanyenkomezi.’<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yayeli aragahezagirwa kurusha abandi bagore bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">Yayeli umugore wa Heberi Umukayini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:24">ahezagirwe kurusha abagore bose baba mu mahema.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Yamusavye amazi, ariko we amuha amata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:25">igikombe kibereye abubahwa ni co yamuzaniyemwo urubu.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Hanyuma agorora ukuboko kwiwe afata urumambo rw’ihema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">ukuboko kwiwe kw’i buryo gufata inyundo y’umwubatsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">Yahonze Sisera, amumena umutwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:26">yaramusabije agahanga aragatobekeranya.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe Sisera arayama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">aratemba, ararambarara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">Imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe arayama, aratemba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:27">aho yayamiye, ni ho yatemvye, aracikana.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Nyina wa Sisera yagumye arabira mw’idirisha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">mu ntoboro zaryo agasemerera ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Ni kuki umukogote wiwe utevye gushika?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:28">Ni kuki umurindi w’imigote yiwe utevye kwumvikana?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Abagore b’incabwenge baramwishura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:29">na we aguma yibwira ati:<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Mbega ntibakiriko baratora bongera bagabura isahu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">umugabo umwe wese afata umugore umwe canke babiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">impuzu z’amabara nk’isahu rya Sisera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">impuzu z’amabara zisharijwe ku mpande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">impuzu zisharijwe cane ku rundi ruhande,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">izo nzokwambara mw’izosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:30">izo zose zivuye mw’isahu.’<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, abansi bawe bose baragahona!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">Ariko abagukunda bose barakamera nk’izuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:31">iyo riserukanye inkomezi zaryo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Nuko igihugu kimara imyaka mirongo ine kiri mu mahoro.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s1">Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Abisirayeli basubira gukora ibibi mu maso y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze aca abarekurira mu maboko y’Abamidiyani babategeka imyaka indwi. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Kubera agacinyizo k’Abamidiyani kari kenshi, vyatumye Abisirayeli baja kwinyegeza mu bihomoka vy’imitumba, mu masenga, no mu bindi bibundo. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Igihe cose Abisirayeli baba barimye imirima yabo, Abamidiyani, Abamaleki hamwe n’amahanga yo mu buseruko baca batera Isirayeli, <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />bagacumbika muri ico gihugu gushika imirima yabo yose bayihoneje kuva ngaho gushika mu gisagara ca Gaza. Basiga Abisirayeli batagira ico barya, ata ntama canke indogoba n’imwe basigaranye. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Abo bansi babo bazanana n’ibitungwa vyabo, bagashinga n’amahema yabo. Baza kubatera ari isinzi nk’inzige ziteye. Baje ku ngamiya zabo ari benshi cane ku buryo ata muntu yashobora kubaharura, basiga basanganguye igihugu rwose. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Abamidiyani batera ubukene Abisirayeli gushika aho baririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngo abatabare.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Abisirayeli bamaze kuririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kubera Abamidiyani, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />aca arungikira umuvugishwa Abisirayeli, ababwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli avuze ati: Ni jewe nabakuye mu buja bwa Egiputa. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Nabarokoye mu bubasha bwa Egiputa, mu gihugu mwarimwo mucunaguzwa. Nirukana abansi banyu, ndabaha igihugu cabo. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Narababwiye nti: ‘Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. Ntimuzosenge imana z’Abamori, bene iki gihugu mubamwo.’ Ariko ntimwanyumviye.”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Uwo mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca aja kwicara musi y’igiti kinini c’i Ofura, cari ica Yowashi wo mu muryango wa Abiyezeri. Gidiyoni mwene Yowashi yariko arasekuririra ingano mu bwato azinyegeje Abamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yiyereka Gidiyoni, amubwira ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe nawe, wa muhizi w’umunyenkomezi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gidiyoni arishura ati: “Nyakwubahwa, nimba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari kumwe natwe, ni kubera iki ibi vyose biriko biradushikira? Mbega vya bitangaza ba sogokuruza bacu bavuga aho batubwira bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we yadukuye muri Egiputa,’ biri hehe? Ko mbona ubu <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yadutaye, akaturekurira mu maboko y’Abamidiyani.”<verse eid="JDG 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arahindukira amubwira ati: “Jana izo nkomezi nyene ufise, ukize Abisirayeli mu maboko y’Abamidiyani. Ni jewe nkurungitse!”<verse eid="JDG 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Ariko Gidiyoni yishura ati: “Mwami, jewe norokora Abisirayeli bigenze gute? Umuryango wanje ni wo muryango wa nyuma mu miryango ya Manase, kandi nanje ndi inyuma y’abandi bose mu muryango wanje.”<verse eid="JDG 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramubarira ati: “Nzoba ndi kumwe nawe, kandi Abamidiyani uzobarandura nk’uwugwanya umuntu umwe.”<verse eid="JDG 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gidiyoni yishura ati: “Nimba nagiriwe ubuntu mu nyonga zawe, nyereka ikimenyetso kinyemeza koko ko ari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuganye nanje. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Ndakwinginze undindire gushika ngaruke, nzane ishikanwa ndagushikanire.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:18">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramwishura ati: “Egome genda, ndakurindira gushika ugarutse.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gidiyoni yinjira mu nzu, ategura umwagazi w’impene, atora n’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 16.</char></note> y’ifu mu giseke, acumba imikate itagira umwambiro. Aca ashira za nyama n’umufa wazo mu gakono, azishikanira wa mumarayika aho yari yicaye musi y’igiti kinini.<verse eid="JDG 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Wa mumarayika w’Imana amubwira ati: “Fata izo nyama n’iyo mikate itambiye, ubishire ku gitandara, uce ubisukako uwo mufa.” Gidiyoni abigenza gutyo. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca abikozako umutwe w’inkoni yari yitwaje. Haca haduka umuriro uva muri ico gitandara, utongora ivyo yari yazanye vyose. Wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca arazimangana. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gidiyoni abonye ko yari umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca araboroga avuga ati: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, mbonye ibara kuko mbonye Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amaso mu yandi.”<verse eid="JDG 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aramuhumuriza ati: “Tekana, ntutinye. Nta co uba!”<verse eid="JDG 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Aho hantu Gidiyoni aca ahubakira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> igicaniro, acita Yahwe Shalomu, bisobanura ngo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we Mahoro. Ico gicaniro kiracahagaze muri Ofura mu Babiyezeri gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Iryo joro <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Gidiyoni ati: “Fata impfizi igira kabiri mu nka za so, irya imaze imyaka indwi. Uce usenyagura igicaniro so yubakiye Bayali, utemagure n’inkingi ya Ashera iri i ruhande yaco. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Hanyuma uce wubaka igicaniro ciza c’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yawe kuri uwu musozi. Uheze utange impfizi igira kabiri nk’ikimazi gituriwe kandi inkwi uzokoresha zibe iz’inkingi za Ashera watemaguye.”<verse eid="JDG 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Nuko Gidiyoni ahitana abakozi biwe icumi, abikora nk’uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yabimubwiye. Ariko yabikoze mw’ijoro kuko yatinya abo mu muryango wiwe hamwe n’abandi bo mu gisagara cabo.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Abantu bo muri ico gisagara bikanguye mu gatondo, basanga igicaniro ca Bayali casanganguwe, n’inkingi za Ashera yari i ruhande yaco bazitemaguriye hasi, basanga na ya mpfizi igira kabiri yatanzwe ku gicaniro gishasha.<verse eid="JDG 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Barabazanya bati: “Ni nde yakoze ibi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 6:29">Batohoje neza bumva ko ari Gidiyoni mwene Yowashi yabigize.<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Abantu bo muri ico gisagara baca babwira Yowashi bati: “Sohokana uwo muhungu wawe. Ategerezwa gupfa kuko yasenyuye igicaniro ca Bayali, agatemagura n’inkingi za Ashera yari impande yaco.”<verse eid="JDG 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Ariko Yowashi yishura abo bantu bari bamugumukanye ati: “Mbega mugira muburanire Bayali? Mugomba kuyirokora? Uwugwanira Bayali wese buza guca yapfuye. Nimba Bayali ari imana y’ukuri, niyigwanire yonyene, irandure uwasenyuye igicaniro cayo.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Uwo musi Gidiyoni baca bamwita Yerubayali, bisigura ngo “Reka Bayali yigwanire”, kuko yasenyuye igicaniro ca Bayali.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Hanyuma y’ivyo Abamidiyani, Abamaleki, n’abandi bo mu buseruko baja hamwe ngo bagwanye Isirayeli, bajabuka Yorodani, bashinga amahema yabo mu kiyaya ca Yezireyeli. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Maze Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuri Gidiyoni, aca avuza inzamba ihamagarira abantu mu ntambara, maze abo mu muryango wa Abiyezeri baramukurikira. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Aca arungika intumwa ku bo mu miryango ya Manase, Asheri, Zebuloni na Nafutali, abahamagarira kuja ku rugamba, na bo baramukurikira.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Gidiyoni asenga Imana avuga ati: “Nimba uza gukirisha Abisirayeli ukuboko kwanje nk’uko wabisezeranye, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />nuvyerekanishe iki kimenyetso: ehe nshize ubwoya bw’intama ku mbuga yo gusekurirako ingano. Ejo mu gatondo nitwasanga ubu bwoya bwatoteshejwe n’urume bwonyene ariko isi yumutse, nzoheza nemere ko uzokirisha Isirayeli ukuboko kwanje nk’uko wabivuze.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Bigenda uko. Gidiyoni avyuka kare mu gatondo, akanya bwa bwoya, buvamwo urume rwinshi, rwokwuzura akabakure.<verse eid="JDG 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Gidiyoni aca abwira Imana ati: “Ntunkarire, ariko reka nongere ngusabe iki kimwe. Unyemerere ndagusabe ikindi kimenyetso kuri ubu bwoya. Ubu na ho, ubu bwoya buzogume bwumye, ariko urume rutose ahabukikuje hose.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Iryo joro Imana ibikora uko. Ubwoya bwonyene buguma bwumutse, ariko isi yuzurako urume.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s1">Gidiyoni anesha Abamidiyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Bukeye mu gatondo ka kare, Yerubayali ari we Gidiyoni hamwe n’abasoda biwe bose bashinga amahema kw’iriba ry’i Harodi. Ikambi y’Abamidiyani yari ruguru yabo mu kiyaya kiri hafi y’umusozi More. <verse eid="JDG 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Gidiyoni ati: “Ufise abasoda benshi cane. Hamwe nobareka bose ngo baje kugwanya Abamidiyani, Abisirayeli bohava bishira hejuru, bakavuga ko inkomezi zabo ari zo zabahaye intsinzi. <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />None rero, barira abantu bose uti: ‘Uwumva afise ubwoba wese nave kuri uno musozi atahe iwe.’ ” Abantu ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bibiri baca basubira inyuma, hasigara ibihumbi cumi gusa.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Ariko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Gidiyoni ati: “N’ubu baracari benshi. Bamanukane ku mazi, ndaza kubisuzumira, ndakwereke abo mujana ku rugamba n’abo mutajana.”<verse eid="JDG 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Nuko Gidiyoni amanukana ba bantu bose ku mazi. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amubwirira kuri ayo mazi ati: “Uraraba utandukanye abantu mu mice ibiri. Abayora amazi bakayanywesha ururimi ku mashi nka kurya kw’imbwa, baje mu mugwi umwe, abapfukama bakayanywesha umunwa na bo baje mu wundi mugwi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Abantu amajana atatu ni bo bayayoje iminwe, abandi na bo barapfukama mu kunywa.<verse eid="JDG 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Gidiyoni ati: “Nzobarokora nongere ndabahe intsinzi ku Bamidiyani nkoresheje abo amajana atatu bayoje amazi iminwe. Abandi barungike basubire mu mihana iwabo.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Gidiyoni aca arungika Abisirayeli basubira iwabo, asigarana abo amajana atatu, ariko basigarana impamba n’inzamba vy’abo basubiye inyuma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:8">Ico gihe ikambi y’Abamidiyani yari mu kiyaya hepfo y’aho Gidiyoni yari ari. <verse eid="JDG 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Muri iryo joro, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira Gidiyoni ati: “Haguruka ugende utere ikambi y’Abamidiyani, kuko nabarekuriye mu maboko yawe. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Ariko nimba wumva ufise ubwoba, hitana umukozi wawe Pura, muje kw’ikambi y’Abamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Nimwumva ivyo bavuga, birabatera intege mubatere.” Nuko Gidiyoni ahitana Pura, baramanuka baja ku mpande z’ikambi y’Abamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Abamidiyani, Abamaleki, n’abandi bose bari bavuye mu buseruko, bakoranira mu kiyaya bangana n’igitero c’inzige, ingamiya zabo zangana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga, ata woziharura.<verse eid="JDG 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gidiyoni ahashitse aca yumva umuntu ariko yiganira mugenziwe indoto yagize, avuga ati: “Naronse mbona irobe ry’umutsima ritembagarira mw’ikambi y’Abamidiyani, ryikubita kw’ihema, ihema riratemba, rigwa ryubamye, rica rirasambuka.”<verse eid="JDG 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Wa mugenzi wiwe aca amwishura ati: “Ivyo si ibindi, ni inkota ya Gidiyoni mwene Yowashi, Umwisirayeli. Imana yarekuriye Abamidiyani hamwe n’ikambi yose mu maboko yiwe.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gidiyoni yumvise iyo ndoto n’ukuntu bayisiguye, ahimbaza Imana. Aca asubira mw’ikambi y’Abisirayeli, asemerera avuga ati: “Haguruka tugende, kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aduhaye intsinzi ku Bamidiyani.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Aca agabura abo bantu amajana atatu mu migwi itatu, umuntu wese amuha inzamba n’akabindi karimwo ikimuri.<verse eid="JDG 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Ababwira ati: “Muje kuguma muraba ivyo nkora vyose. Nitwashika ku mahema ya mbere, ivyo nja gukora namwe abe ari vyo mukora. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Jewe n’abo turi kumwe nitwavuza inzamba abakikuje ikambi mwese muce muvuza izanyu, musemerere muti: ‘Ku bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no ku bwa Gidiyoni.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Gidiyoni na bamwe ijana bari kumwe na we bashika ku nsago za mbere, umuteramyi wa mbere ari ho agiheza, bavyuye uwa kabiri. Baca bavuza inzamba, bamenagura na twa tubindi bari bafise mu minwe. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Ya migwi itatu yose ica ivuza inzamba, imenagura na twa tubindi. Bafata vya bimuri mu kubamfu, mu kuryo na ho bafata za nzamba, bose barasemerera bati: “Fata inkota ku bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na Gidiyoni!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Umuntu wese yagumye ahagaze aho yari ari bakikuje ikambi, Abamidiyani bose bahunga bakoma induru.<verse eid="JDG 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Bamwe amajana atatu bavugije inzamba, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca atuma abari muri iryo kambi bahindukiriranira, bamaranisha inkota zabo. Abacitse kw’icumu bahungira i Beti-Shita ahaherereye i Zerera, bashika ku rubibe rwa Abeli-Mehola hafi ya Tabati. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Gidiyoni aca atumako abo mu miryango ya Nafutali, Asheri, hamwe n’Abamanase bose, bakurikira Abamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gidiyoni atumako n’abo mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu ababwira ati: “Nimumanuke tugwanye Abamidiyani. Mubatangirire kuri Yorodani ku majabukiro y’i Beti-Bara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 7:24">Nuko Abefurayimu babikora nk’uko babwiwe. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Bafata abarongozi babiri b’Abamidiyani, Orebu na Zeyebu. Bicira Orebu ku gitandara ca Orebu, Zeyebu na we bamwicira kw’ibuye rya Zeyebu. Bakurikira Abamidiyani, bazanira Gidiyoni n’imitwe ya Orebu na Zeyebu aho yari ari kuri Yorodani.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s1">Zeba na Zalimuna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Abo mu muryango wa Efurayimu babaza Gidiyoni bati: “Mbega ni iki watugaye catumye udufata uko? Ni kubera iki utaduhamagaye ngo tujane igihe waja gutera Abamidiyani?” Baramwidodombera cane.<verse eid="JDG 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Ariko arabishura ati: “Mbega jewe maze iki mungereranije na mwebwe? Mbega imizabibu mwebwe Abefurayimu musiga yo guhumba ntisumba umwimbu wose w’Abiyezeri? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Imana yarekuriye Orebu na Zeyebu, abarongozi b’Abamidiyani, mu maboko yanyu. Jewe ni igiki nakoze gihwanye n’ico mwakoze?” Ababwiye ivyo, imyidodombo yabo ica iragabanuka.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Gidiyoni na bamwe amajana atatu bari kumwe bararuha, ariko baguma bakurikira umwansi wabo, bashika kuri Yorodani bararujabuka. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Gidiyoni abarira abantu b’i Sukoti ati: “Ndabasavye mumpere abasoda ivyokurya kuko bararushe. Ndiko nkurikira Zeba na Zalimuna, abami b’Abamidiyani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Ariko abatware b’i Sukoti bamwishura bati: “Mbega aho tubaha ivyokurya, Zalimuna na Zeba mwabafashe? Abasoda bawe tubahera indya iki batarabafata?”<verse eid="JDG 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Gidiyoni arabishura ati: “Ko munyishuye uko, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> niyamara kurekurira Zeba na Zalimuna mu maboko yanje, mwebwe nzobahindukirira imibiri yanyu ndayishishaguze amahwa yo mw’ishamba n’imibambangwe.”<verse eid="JDG 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Bavuye aho baca baduga i Peniyeli, basaba ivyokurya gutyo nyene, ariko abantu baho babishura nk’ab’i Sukoti. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Gidiyoni aca abwira abantu b’i Peniyeli ati: “Ninagaruka nzanye intsinzi nzosambura uwu munara.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Zeba na Zalimuna bari i Karukori bari kumwe n’abasoda ibihumbi cumi na bitanu. Abo ni bo bari basigaye muri abo basoda bo mu buseruko bose bari bagiye hamwe, kuko abandi ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ibiri bari bamaze kugwa ku rugamba. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Nuko Gidiyoni afata ibarabara ryo mu buseruko bwa Noba na Yogibeha, ahasanga izo ngabo arazitera giturumbuka. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Zeba na Zalimuna, abami babiri b’Abamidiyani, barahunga, ariko aboma inyuma, arabafata, afata n’abasoda babo bose.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Gidiyoni mwene Yowashi aragaruka avuye ku rugamba, aca mu nzira ya Heresi. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Afata umusore ava i Sukoti, uwo musore amwandikira amazina y’abatware mirongo indwi ba Sukoti, ari bo bakuru b’ico gisagara. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Maze Gidiyoni abwira abantu b’i Sukoti ati: “Ngaba Zeba na Zalimuna, abo mwanshinyaguriza, muvuga muti: ‘Mbega Zeba na Zalimuna mwabafashe? Ni kubera iki twoha ivyokurya abantu bawe barushe?’ ” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Gidiyoni aca afata ba batware b’igisagara, arabahana, abashishaguza amahwa yo mw’ishamba n’imibambangwe. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Yongera asenyura umunara w’i Peniyeli, yica n’abatware b’ico gisagara.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Aca abaza Zeba na Zalimuna ati: “Abantu mwishe i Tabori bari bameze gute?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 8:18">Na bo barishura bati: “Bari abantu bameze nk’uko kwanyu, basa n’abana b’abami.”<verse eid="JDG 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gidiyoni ababwira ati: “Barya bari abavukanyi banje, abahungu bavuka kuri mama. Ndabarahiye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, iyo muba mutabishe, nanje sinari kubica.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Aca ahindukirira Yeteri umuhungu wiwe w’imfura, amubwira ati: “Bice!” Ariko Yeteri aratinya gufata inkota yiwe kuko yari akiri muto, ahinda agashitsi.<verse eid="JDG 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Zeba na Zalimuna bavuga babwira Gidiyoni bati: “Twiyicire wewe nyene, ibigumye bikora abagabo.” Nuko Gidiyoni ava hasi arabica, aca yambura ingamiya zabo ibitako vy’inyambarabami ku mazosi yazo.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efodi ya Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Inyuma y’ivyo, Abisirayeli babwira Gidiyoni bati: “Nabe ari wewe udutwara! Abana bawe n’abuzukuru bawe bazobe abatware bacu kuko wadukuye mu maboko y’Abamidiyani.”<verse eid="JDG 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Ariko Gidiyoni ababwira ati: “Sinzobatwara kandi n’abana banje ntibazobatwara. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we azoguma abatwara.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Yongera ababwira ati: “Ndafise ikintu kimwe ndabasaba: umwe wese muri mwebwe ampe ihereni rimwe ku yo mwanyaze.” (Wari umugenzo mu bo kwa Ishimayeli kwambara amahereni y’inzahabu.)<verse eid="JDG 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Baramwishura bati: “Turemeye kuriguha ata kagobero.” Nuko basanza umutamana hasi, umuntu wese atererako ihereni rimwe mu yo yanyaze. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Amahereni y’inzahabu yaronse yapima shekeli igihumbi n’amajana indwi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 20.</char></note> ukuyemwo ibisharizo vy’inyambarabami vy’ingamiya, utugenegene two kwambara tw’inzahabu, n’impuzu z’agahama zambarwa n’abami b’Abamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Izo nzahabu Gidiyoni azikoramwo efodi ayishira muri Ofura, mu gisagara ciwe. Ariko ubwo nyene Abisirayeli baca bakora ubusambanyi mu kuyisenga, ivyo bica biba umutego kuri Gidiyoni n’umuryango wiwe.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Gidiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Uko ni ko Abisirayeli banesheje Abamidiyani, barabaganza, ntibapfa basubiriye kubiganzura. Mu yindi myaka mirongo ine Gidiyoni yabayeho, Isirayeli yari mu mahoro.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Yerubayali mwene Yowashi aca asubira i muhira iwe. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Yari afise abahungu mirongo indwi yivyariye, kuko yari afise abagore benshi. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Umugore wiwe yaba i Shekemu na we nyene yamuvyayeko umwana w’umuhungu, amwita Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gidiyoni mwene Yowashi apfa ashaje cane, bamuhamba hamwe na se Yowashi muri Ofura, mu muryango w’Abiyezeri.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Gidiyoni agipfa, Abisirayeli baciye basubira gusambana mu gusenga za Bayali, bahagarika Bayali-Beriti nk’imana yabo, <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />bibagira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo yabarokoye mu maboko y’abansi bari babakikuje. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Kandi ikigeretseko, ntibigeze bafata neza umuryango wa Yerubayali ari we Gidiyoni ku bw’ivyiza vyose yabakoreye.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Umusi umwe, Abimeleki mwene Yerubayali aja kuramutsa ba inarume. Arababwira be n’abo mu muryango wa nyina bose ati: <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Nimubaze abatware b’i Shekemu muti: ‘Mbega ikibereye ni iki? Ko mwotwarwa n’abahungu mirongo indwi ba Yerubayali, canke ko mwotwarwa n’umwe?’ Kandi mwibuke ko dusangiye amaraso.”<verse eid="JDG 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Ba inarume babishikirije abantu b’i Shekemu, bose bemera kurongorwa na Abimeleki, kuko bavuga bati: “Ni umuvukanyi wacu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Baca baha Abimeleki shekeli mirongo indwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 800.</char></note> z’ifeza bakuye mu ngoro ya Bayali-Beriti, na we azikoresha mu guhemba abantu b’imburakimazi kandi b’inkozi z’ibibi bamugendanira. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Aja i muhira kwa se muri Ofura, yicira ku gitandara kimwe benewabo mirongo indwi, ari bo bahungu ba Yerubayali. Ariko Yotamu, umuhungu mutoya, aramucika kuko yari yinyegeje. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Maze ababa i Shekemu n’i Beti-Milo bose baca bakoranira musi y’igiti kinini kiri impande y’inkingi y’i Shekemu bimika Abimeleki nk’umwami.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Yotamu avyumvise, aca aduga ku musozi Gerizimu, arasemerera ati: “Nimunyumvirize yemwe batware b’i Shekemu! Nimunyumvirize nimba mushaka ko Imana ibumviriza. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Umusi umwe ibiti vyagiye kwiyimikira umwami wavyo. Ubwa mbere bibarira umwelayo biti: ‘Tubere umwami.’<verse eid="JDG 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Ariko umwelayo uravyishura uti: ‘Ariko noheba amavuta yanje ahesha icubahiro Imana n’abantu, ngo nze kwirirwa ndahungabana hejuru y’ibiti?’<verse eid="JDG 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Hanyuma bibwira umusukoni bati: ‘Ingo wewe utubere umwami.’<verse eid="JDG 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Ariko na wo nyene uvyishura uti: ‘Ariko noheba insukoni zanje n’ukuntu zisosa, nkirirwa ndahungabana hejuru y’ibiti?’<verse eid="JDG 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Ni ko kubaza umuzabibu biti: ‘Ingo wewe utubere umwami.’<verse eid="JDG 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Ariko umuzabibu uvyishura uti: ‘Ariko noheba umutobe wanje, uryohera Imana n’abantu, nkaja kwirirwa ndahungabana hejuru y’ibiti?’<verse eid="JDG 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Ubwa nyuma ibiti vyose bibwira umukere, biti: ‘Ingo utubere umwami.’<verse eid="JDG 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Umukere wishura ibiti uti: ‘Nimba mushaka kunyimika ngo mbe umwami wanyu vy’ukuri, nimuze muhungire musi y’igitutu canje; bitari uko, umuriro uce uza uvuye mu mukere uturire amasederi yose y’i Libani!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Yotamu abandanya ababwira ati: “None rero nimurabe neza nimba mwakoze ibibereye kandi bivuye mu kwizera mu kwimika Abimeleki nk’umwami, kandi nimba mwakoreye ibibereye Yerubayali n’umuryango wiwe, mukamufata uko bibereye. <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Kuko mwibuke ko data yabagwaniye, ntiyatinyira ubuzima bwiwe kugira ngo abarokore mu maboko y’Abamidiyani. <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />Ariko uwu musi mwagararije data n’uruvyaro rwiwe, mwicira abahungu biwe mirongo indwi ku gitandara kimwe. Kandi mufashe umuhungu wo ku mugore w’umugurano wiwe Abimeleki aba ari we mwimika nk’umwami wa Shekemu kuko ari incuti yanyu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />None rero nimba Yerubayali n’uruvyaro rwiwe mwabakoreye ivy’icubahiro, vyiza kandi bivuye mu kwizera, nimunezerererwe Abimeleki, kandi na we nabanezerererwe. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Ariko nimba mutakoze ibikorwa vyiza bivuye mu kwizera, umuriro uce uza uvuye kuri Abimeleki ubatongore, mwebwe abatware b’i Shekemu n’i Beti-Milo, kandi umuriro uce ugenda uvuye muri mwebwe ab’i Shekemu n’i Beti-Milo, utongore Abimeleki.”<verse eid="JDG 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Yotamu aca arahunga aja i Beyeri, agumayo kuko yatinya mwenewabo Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Inyuma y’ivyo Abimeleki atwara Isirayeli imyaka itatu, <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />maze Imana irungika impwemu hagati ya Abimeleki n’abatware b’i Shekemu, baramuhemukira, baramugumukana. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Ivyo Imana yabikoze kugira ngo ihore ikibi bene Yerubayali bakorewe mu guseserwa amaraso na mwenewabo Abimeleki hamwe n’ab’i Shekemu bamufashije kwica benewabo. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Mu kumugarariza, abatware b’i Shekemu barungitse abantu baja kwinyegeza ku misozi hejuru, bagasahura uwurengana wese. Ariko ivyo birahava bishikira Abimeleki.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Umusi umwe Gayali mwene Ebedi aja i Shekemu ari kumwe na benewabo, maze yizerwa n’abatware b’i Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Bamaze kuja mu mirima bakimbura inzabibu bakazigana, bagirira umusi mukuru w’iyimbura mu ngoro y’ikigirwamana cabo. Bariko bararya banywa, batangura kuvuma Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gayali mwene Ebedi aravuga ati: “Mbega Abimeleki ni iki, kandi Shekemu ni iki kugira ngo tube abasavyi biwe? Mbe si mwene Yerubayali, kandi uwu Zebuli si icegera ciwe? Enda nimuze dukorere abakomoka kuri Hamori, sekuruza w’ab’i Shekemu aho gukorera Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Icari kumpa aba bantu nkabatwara, noca nkuraho Abimeleki. Nobwira Abimeleki nti: ‘Shaka uzanane n’ingabo zawe zose tugwane!’ ”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebuli umukuru w’ico gisagara yumvise ivyo Gayali mwene Ebedi avuze, ararakara cane. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Aca arungika intumwa kuri Abimeleki muri Aruma, amubwira ati: “Gayali mwene Ebedi hamwe na benewabo baje kuba i Shekemu, none bariko baragumura igisagara cose ngo bakugararize. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />None rero uze guhengera mw’ijoro uzanane n’ingabo zawe, mubategerere mu gahinga. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Mu gatondo ka kare izuba rigiye guseruka muje gutera igisagara. Gayali n’ingabo ziwe nibaza kubagwanya, muze kubagira uko mushaka.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Nuko Abimeleki n’ingabo ziwe zose bafata inzira mw’ijoro baragenda, bicamwo imigwi ine, bagira ibirindiro bikikuje Shekemu. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Gayali mwene Ebedi yari ahagaze mw’irembo ry’igisagara igihe Abimeleki n’abasoda biwe basokoroka bava aho bari binyegeje.<verse eid="JDG 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gayali ababonye abarira Zebuli ati: “Ehe bariya bantu bariko baramanuka bavuye hejuru ku misozi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 9:36">Zebuli amwishura ati: “Eka si bo witiranije ibitutu vy’imisozi n’abantu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Ariko Gayali aramubwira ati: “Eka raba, ni abantu bariko baramanuka bavuye ku misozi, kandi uwundi mugwi na wo uriko uzanana mu nzira ica impande y’igiti ca ba kamenyi.”<verse eid="JDG 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Maze Zebuli aramubwira ati: “Aho wahereye wirata, reka ubu rero turabe ingene ubigenza. Ntiwavuze ngo: ‘Mbega Abimeleki ni iki aho adutwara?’ Aba si ba bantu wacokora? Genda rero ubagwanye turabe!”<verse eid="JDG 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Nuko Gayali asohokana abatware b’i Shekemu baja kugwanya Abimeleki. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimeleki aramwirukana, kandi benshi mu b’i Shekemu barakomereka, bagenda baragwa mu nzira gushika kw’irembo ry’igisagara. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimeleki aca asubira muri Aruma, Zebuli na we yomora Gayali na benewabo abakura mu gisagara ca Shekemu.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Ku musi ukurikira, abantu b’i Shekemu baja mu ntambara. Abimeleki abimenye, <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />aca agabura ingabo ziwe mu migwi itatu baja kubunda mu gahinga. Abonye basohotse igisagara, aca arahaguruka aho yari abunze, arabatera. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimeleki n’umugwi bari kumwe baca bihutira gutangira ku muryango w’igisagara kugira ngo abuze abagaruka mu gihe iyindi migwi yariko iratikiriza abandi mu gahinga. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Uwo musi wose Abimeleki yawumaze atera ico gisagara, gushika agifate. Aca agisanzamwo umunyu cose.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Ababa mu munara w’i Shekemu bavyumvise baca baja kwinyegeza mu ruzitiro rukomeye rw’ikibanza co gusengeramwo ibigirwamana ca Bayali-Beriti. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Abimeleki yumvise ko bakoraniyeyo, <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />aca aduga ku musozi Zalumoni. Aca afata ishoka, atemagura amashami y’ibiti, ayikorera ku bitugu. Aca abwira abo bari kumwe ati: “Nimunyarutse, mugire nk’uko nagize.” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Nuko bose baca amashami, bakurikira Abimeleki. Bayarundanya kuri wa munara, bawuturirana n’abantu bari muri wo. Abari muri wo bose bapfirayo, bashika nk’abantu igihumbi, abagore n’abagabo.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Mu nyuma y’aho, Abimeleki aca atera igisagara ca Tebezi, aragifata. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Ariko hagati muri ico gisagara harimwo iminara ikomakomeye abagore n’abagabo, ndetse n’abantu bose baba muri ico gisagara bayihungiramwo. Bayiyugaraniramwo baca baduga ku nsenge zayo. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Abimeleki aja kuri iyo minara arayugariza. Yegereye ku miryango yayo ngo ayiturire, <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />umugore yari hejuru ku munara aca amukororerako urusyo, rumumena umutwe.<verse eid="JDG 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Abimeleki aca abarira umugendanyi wiwe yamutwaza ibigwanisho yihuta ati: “Fata inkota yawe ningoga unyice, ntibazovuge ngo Abimeleki yishwe n’umugore!” Wa mugendanyi wiwe aca arayimusogota, aca arapfa. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Abisirayeli babonye Abimeleki apfuye, baca basubira mu mihana yabo.<verse eid="JDG 9:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Gutyo Imana iba irahanye Abimeleki kubera ikibi yakoreye se wiwe mu kugandagura benewabo mirongo indwi. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Imana yongera iba ihaniye abantu b’i Shekemu ububisha bwabo. Umuvumo wa Yotamu mwene Yerubayali ari we Gidiyoni uba urabashitseko.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Inyuma ya Abimeleki, umuntu wo mu muryango wa Isakari, yitwa Tola mwene Puwa, umwuzukuru wa Dodo, arahaguruka arokora Isirayeli. Yaba i Shamiri, mu karere k’imisozi ka Efurayimu. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Arongora Isirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri n’itatu, hanyuma arapfa, ahambwa i Shamiri.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yayiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Tora yakurikiwe na Yayiro w’i Gileyadi, yarongoye Isirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri n’ibiri. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Yari afise abahungu mirongo itatu, n’indogoba mirongo itatu yagenderako, kandi yaganza n’ibisagara mirongo itatu mu ntara ya Gileyadi. Ivyo bisagara biracitwa ibisagara vya Yayiro gushika n’ubu. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Yayiro apfuye, yahambwe i Kamoni.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yefuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Isirayeli isubira gukora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu maso yiwe. Bakorera Bayali na Ashitaroti n’izindi mana zo muri Aramu, i Sidoni, i Mowabu, muri Amoni n’iz’Abafilisitiya. Bava k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ntibaba bakimukorera na gatoya. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buziriringira Abisirayeli, abarekurira mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya n’Abamoni, <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />batangura kubacinyiza uwo mwaka nyene. Bamara imyaka icumi n’umunani batwaza umukazo Abisirayeli baba mu buseruko bwa Yorodani, mu ntara y’Abamori ari yo Gileyadi. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Abamoni na bo nyene bajabuka Yorodani baja gutera umuryango wa Yuda, uwa Benyamini n’uwa Efurayimu; Abisirayeli bari mu gatengo gahambaye. <verse eid="JDG 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Maze Abisirayeli baririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bavuga bati: “Twaragucumuyeko, kuko twagutaye ari wewe Mana yacu, tugakorera za Bayali.”<verse eid="JDG 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arabishura ati: “Igihe Abanyegiputa, Abamori, Abamoni, Abafilisitiya, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Abanyesidoni, Abamaleki n’Abamawoni babacinyiza, ntimwandiriye nkabatabara? Sinabarokoye mu maboko yabo? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Ariko mwarantaye mukorera izindi mana. None rero singisubira kubarokora. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Nimugende muririre ziriya mana zindi mwahisemwo. Nizibe ari zo zibatabara mu marushwa yanyu!”<verse eid="JDG 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Ariko Abisirayeli babarira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bati: “Twaracumuye. Duhane uko ubigomvye ariko upfe kudukiza uwu musi.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Baca bakura imana z’inyamahanga muri bo, bakorera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyaba agishobora kwihanganira amagorwa y’Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Igihe Abamoni bari bakoraniye i Gileyadi ngo baje mu ntambara, Abisirayeli na bo bari bakoraniye i Misipa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Abarongozi b’i Gileyadi babwirana bati: “Uwuza gutera Abamoni ubwa mbere ni we azoca aba umurongozi w’Abagileyadi.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Hari umugabo yitwa Yefuta yari Umunyagileyadi, yari umugwanyi akomeye cane. Se yitwa Gileyadi, nyina akaba maraya. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Umugore wa Gileyadi yari yaravyaye n’abandi bahungu, bamaze gukura birukana Yefuta, bamubwira bati: “Nta ragi na ritoya uzoronka muri uwu muryango, kuko wavutse kuri maraya.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Yefuta aca ahunga benewabo, aja kuba mu ntara ya Tobu, aho yasanze umugwi w’abantu b’inyererezi b’inkozi z’ibibi, baramukurikira.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Haheze igihe, Abamoni bateye Isirayeli, <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />abatware b’i Gileyadi batumako Yefuta mu ntara ya Tobu. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Bamubwira bati: “Ingo utubere umugabisha w’ingabo, kugira ngo dushobore kugwanya Abamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Yefuta arabishura ati: “Mbega ntimwanyanse, mukanyirukana mu nzu ya data? Ubu rero muraje kundondera ko muri mu magorwa!”<verse eid="JDG 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Abatware b’i Gileyadi baramubwira bati: “Ni wewe duhanze amaso! Niwaturongora muri iyi ntambara, tukagwanya Abamoni tukabatsinda, tuzokugira uwutwara ababa i Gileyadi bose.”<verse eid="JDG 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Yefuta arabishura ati: “Hinge twumvikane neza. Hamwe nje kugwanya Abamoni, hanyuma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> akabarekurira mu maboko yanje, muremera neza ko nzoca mba umutware wanyu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Ba batware bamwishura bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni we cabona cacu. Turemeye ko tuzobikora uko nyene ubivuze.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Nuko Yefuta ajana n’abo batware b’i Gileyadi, bamugira umugabisha w’ingabo zose. Ageze i Misipa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Yefuta asubiramwo ya majambo yose yavugana n’abatware.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Yefuta arungikira intuma umwami w’Abamoni, amubaza ati: “Mbega uturonderako iki ko uteye igihugu cacu?”<verse eid="JDG 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Umwami w’Abamoni na we yishura intumwa ya Yefuta ati: “Igihe Isirayeli yaduga iva muri Egiputa, banyaze intara yanje kuva ku ruzi Arunoni gushika kuri Yaboki, ukabandanya no gushika kuri Yorodani. None rero nimuhansubize mu mahoro n’umutekano.”<verse eid="JDG 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Yefuta asubira kurungika intumwa ku mwami w’Abamoni <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="JDG 11:15">“Uku ni ko Yefuta avuze: Isirayeli ntiyanyaze intara ya Mowabu canke y’Abamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Ariko igihe bava muri Egiputa, Abisirayeli baciye mu bugaragwa baja ku Kiyaga Gitukura barabandanya bashika i Kadeshi. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Hanyuma barungikira intumwa umwami wa Edomu bamubwira bati: ‘Twemerere duce mu gihugu cawe.’ Ariko umwami wa Edomu ntiyatwemerera. Bongera barungika intumwa ku mwami wa Mowabu, na we nyene aranka. Abisirayeli baca baguma i Kadeshi.<verse eid="JDG 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Bavuye aho baciye baca mu bugaragwa, bazunguruka intara za Edomu na Mowabu, baca baja mu buseruko bw’igihugu ca Mowabu, bashinga amahema yabo i ruhande y’uruzi Arunoni. Ntibigeze binjira mu ntara ya Mowabu kuko Arunoni ni rwo rwari urubibe rwaho.<verse eid="JDG 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Nuko Abisirayeli barungika intumwa kuri Sihoni umwami w’Abamori yaba i Heshiboni, zimubwira ziti: ‘Twemerere duce mu guhugu cawe kugira ngo dushike mu gihugu cacu.’ <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Ariko Sihoni ntiyizera ivyo Abisirayeli bavuze, ababuza guca mu guhugu ciwe. Aca akoranya ingabo ziwe zose zija i Yahiza kugwanya Abisirayeli.<verse eid="JDG 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli arekurira Sihoni n’ingabo ziwe mu maboko y’Abisirayeli, barabanesha. Abisirayeli baca bafata intara yose y’Abamori baba muri ico gihugu, <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />bagifata bahereye kuri Arunoni gushika kuri Yaboki, no kuva mu bugaragwa gushika kuri Yorodani.<verse eid="JDG 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Urabona rero ko ari <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli yafashe iyo ntara y’Abamori iyiha Isirayeli. None ni iki cotuma tuyibasubiza? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Mbega mweho ntimugumya ico Kemoshi imana yanyu yabahaye? Natwe ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yacu yaduhaye cose turakigumya. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Mbega usumba Balaki mwene Zipori, umwami w’i Mowabu? Yarigeze atongana n’Abisirayeli canke ngo abagwanye? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Haheze imyaka amajana atatu Abisirayeli baba i Heshiboni, muri Aroweri no mu micungararo yaho, hamwe no mu bisagara biri ku nkengera ya Arunoni. None ubu ni ho uje kubibohoza? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Nta kibi nabakoreye, ariko ni wewe ugize nabi kuza kuntera. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> we mucamanza, abe ari we acira urubanza Abisirayeli n’Abamoni.”<verse eid="JDG 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Ariko umwami wa Amoni ntiyitaho ubwo butumwa Yefuta yamurungikiye.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Ico gihe Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuri Yefuta, ajabuka Gileyadi na Manase, aca i Misipehi h’i Gileyadi, avuye aho aca ayobora abasoda baja gutera Abamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Yefuta asezeranira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Niwampa intsinzi ku Bamoni, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />ikija gusohoka kunsanganira ntahanye intsinzi ku Bamoni kizoba ari ic’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nza kugishikana nk’ishikanwa rituriwe.”<verse eid="JDG 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Nuko Yefuta aja kugwanya Abamoni, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuha intsinzi kuri bo. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Asambura ibisagara mirongo ibiri kuva Aroweri gushika mu bisagara vya Miniti no muri Abeli-Keramimu. Maze Abisirayeli banesha Abamoni.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Yefuta agarutse i muhira i Misipa, ntihagira uwundi aza kumusanganira atari umukobwa wiwe, aza atambatamba ku gashako k’ingoma. Ni we mwana yari afise wenyene; nta wundi muhungu canke umukobwa yari afise. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Amubonye yitaburirako impuzu, asemerera ati: “Ewe mwana wanje urakankoreye! Urankwegeye amahano! Kuko nasezeraniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kandi sinisubirako.”<verse eid="JDG 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Na we amwishura ati: “Data, nimba hari ico wasezeraniye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ngira uko wasezeranye kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhaye intsinzi nini ku bansi bawe, ari bo Bamoni. <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Ariko unyemerere iki kimwe gusa: umpe amezi abiri, nduge mu mitumba nje kurirana n’abagenzi banje kuko nzopfa ntarongowe.”<verse eid="JDG 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Yefuta aramubwira ati: “Nugende.” Aramureka aragenda amarayo amezi abiri. We na bagenzi biwe baduga mu mitumba bararira kuko azopfa atarongowe. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Amezi abiri aheze, aca agaruka kwa se, na we amugira nk’uko yari yarasezeranye. Yapfuye ari inkumi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 11:39">Vyahavuye biba umugenzo mu Bisirayeli <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />igihe cose uko umwaka utashe, inkumi z’Abisirayeli zarava mu gisagara zikamara imisi ine zibuka umukobwa wa Yefuta, Umunyagileyadi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yefuta na Efurayimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Abantu bo mu muryango wa Efurayimu bakoranya ingabo zabo, bajabuka Yorodani baja i Zafoni, babarira Yefuta bati: “Ni kubera iki wagiye kugwanya Abamoni utaduhamagaye ngo tujane? Tugira tuguturirane n’inzu yawe.”<verse eid="JDG 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Yefuta arishura ati: “Jewe n’abantu banje twari mu ngorane zikomeye n’Abamoni, kandi igihe nabahamagara, ntimwigeze muza kuntabara mu maboko yabo. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Mbonye mutaje kuntabara naciye nibako nja kubagwanya tutari kumwe, kandi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yampaye intsinzi ku Bamoni. None ubu ni igiki gitumye muza kungwanya?”<verse eid="JDG 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Yefuta aca akoranya abantu b’i Gileyadi kugira ngo bagwanye aba Efurayimu. Abanyagileyadi barabatera, barabanesha, barabica kuko aba Efurayimu bari bavuze bati: “Mwebwe Abanyagileyadi muri abahunze bava mu turere twa Efurayimu na Manase.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Abanyagileyadi bafata ivyambu vyo kuri Yorodani bija muri Efurayimu. Uwucitse kw’icumu mu bo kwa Efurayimu avuze ati: “Nimundeke ndengane,” Abanyagileyadi bakamubaza bati: “Uri uwo mu Befurayimu?” Akishura ati: “Oya,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />baca bamubwira bati: “Subiramwo uti ‘Shiboleti.’ ” Ari Umwefurayimu yaca avuga ati: “Siboleti,” kuko Abefurayimu batashobora kuvuga neza iryo jambo. Baca bamufata bakamwicira kw’ijabukiro rya Yorodani. Ico gihe hishwe abantu bangana n’ibihumbi mirongo ine na bibiri vy’Abefurayimu.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Yefuta aca amara imyaka itandatu arongora Abisirayeli. Maze Yefuta Umunyagileyadi apfuye, ahambwa mu gisagara ca Gileyadi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibuzani, Eloni na Abudoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Inyuma ya Yefuta haza Ibuzani w’i Betelehemu, arongora Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Yari afise abahungu mirongo itatu n’abakobwa mirongo itatu nyene. Abakobwa biwe barongowe mu yindi miryango, maze na we azana abandi bakobwa mirongo itatu bavuye mu yindi miryango, barongorwa n’abahungu biwe. Ibuzani arongora Abisirayeli imyaka indwi. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Hanyuma arapfa, ahambwa i Betelehemu.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Inyuma yiwe haje Eloni yava mu muryango wa Zebuloni, arongora Abisirayeli imyaka icumi. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Hanyuma arapfa, ahambwa muri Ayijaloni mu ntara ya Zebuloni.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Eloni amaze gupfa, haje Abudoni mwene Hileli, yava i Piratoni, arongora Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Yari afise abahungu mirongo ine, n’abuzukuru b’abahungu mirongo itatu, bari bafise indogoba mirongo indwi bagenderako. Yarongoye Abisirayeli imyaka umunani. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Apfuye, yahambwe i Piratoni mu ntara ya Efurayimu, mu misozi y’Abamaleki.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ivuka rya Samusoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Abisirayeli basubira gukora ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abona ko ari bibi mu maso yiwe, maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarekurira mu maboko y’Abafilisitiya, babacunaguza imyaka mirongo ine.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Hariho umugabo yaba i Zora yitwa Manowa, yava mu muryango wa Dani, yari afise umugore w’ingumba, babaho ata mwana bafise. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abonekera uwo mugore, amubwira ati: “Naho uri ingumba ata mwana ufise, ugiye gusama inda, uvyare umwana w’umuhungu. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Nuko rero wirinde, ntihagire umuvinyu canke ikiboreza, canke ico kurya gihumanye kizokugera ku munwa. <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Uzotwara inda uvyare umwana w’umuhungu. Ntihagire urwembe ruzomugera ku mutwe. Kuko uwo muhungu azokwegurirwa Imana nk’Umunaziri kuva akivuka. Ni we azotangura igikorwa co kurokora Abisirayeli mu minwe y’Abafilisitiya.”<verse eid="JDG 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Wa mugore aca arirukanga, abwira umugabo wiwe ati: “Hari umuntu w’Imana yaje aho ndi. Yasa n’umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, yari ateye ubwoba kuraba. Sinamubajije iyo aje ava, kandi ntiyambwiye izina ryiwe. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Ariko yambwiye ati: ‘Uzotwara inda, uvyare umwana w’umuhungu. Ntihazogire umuvinyu canke ikiboreza uzonywa, kandi ntihazogire ikintu gihumanye uzorya, kuko uwo muhungu azoba Umunaziri w’Imana kuva akivuka gushika apfe.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Maze Manowa aca asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: “Ndakwinginze Uhoraho, uturungikire uwo muntu w’Imana watumye, agaruke atwigishe ingene dukwiye kurera uwo mwana agiye kuvuka.”<verse eid="JDG 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Imana yumva isengesho rya Manowa, wa mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> asubira kwiyereka wa mugore ari mu mirima, ariko Manowa umugabo wiwe ntibari kumwe. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Wa mugore aca arirukanga abwira umugabo wiwe ati: “Wa muntu yanyiyereka wa musi yagarutse!”<verse eid="JDG 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Manowa aca arahaguruka akurikira umugore wiwe. Bashikiriye wa muntu, Manowa aramubaza ati: “Ni wewe uvuganye n’umugore wanje?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 13:11">Na we yishura ati: “Ni jewe nyene!”<verse eid="JDG 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Manowa aca amubaza ati: “Ivyo wavuze nivyashika, mbega amategeko azogenga uwo mwana ku bw’ubuzima bwiwe n’ivyo azokora azoba ameze gute?”<verse eid="JDG 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Wa mumarayika amwishura ati: “Umugore wawe aze akore ivyo namubwiye vyose. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Ntaze arye inzabibu, canke ngo anywe umuvinyu canke ikindi cose kiboreza, canke ngo arye ikintu na kimwe gihumanye. Hanyuma azokurikize ivyo namubariye vyose.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manowa aca abarira uwo mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Turakwinginze ugume ngaha tugutegurire ishashi y’impene ufungure.”<verse eid="JDG 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Wa mumarayika aramwishura ati: “Naho mwongumiza ngaha, sinobarira igifungurwa na kimwe. Ariko murashobora gutegura ikimazi co guturirwa, mukagihereza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” (Manowa ntiyari yamenye ko ari umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.)<verse eid="JDG 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Nuko Manowa abaza uwo mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ati: “Izina ryawe ni nde kugira ngo tuzokwibuke ivyo wavuze nivyashika?”<verse eid="JDG 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />Na we arishura ati: “Ni kubera iki ugomba kumenya izina ryanje? Ni izina rirengeye ugutahura kwawe.” <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Manowa aca afata umwagazi w’impene hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ifu, abishikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku gitandara. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca akora igitangaza Manowa n’umugore wiwe babona: <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Imbeya ziriko zirarabagirana ziduga mu kirere, wa mumarayika aca aduga muri izo mbeya. Manowa n’umugore wiwe babibonye, baca bakubita amavi hasi barunama. <verse eid="JDG 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Uwo mumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntiyabaye agisubira kwiyereka Manowa n’umugore wiwe, Manowa aca aratahura ko yari umumarayika w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="JDG 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Aca abarira umugore wiwe ati: “Nta kabuza turapfuye, kuko twabonye Imana.”<verse eid="JDG 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Ariko umugore wiwe aramubwira ati: “Iyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> agomba kutwica, ntiyari kutwakirira ikimazi gituriwe n’ishikanwa ry’ifu twamuhereje, canke ngo atwereke ivyo twabonye, ntiyari no kutubwira ivyo yatubwiye.”<verse eid="JDG 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Haheze igihe, uwo mugore avyara umwana w’umuhungu, amwita Samusoni. Arakura, kandi umuhezagiro w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uba kuri we, <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atangura gukorera muri we ari i Mahane Dani, hagati y’ibisagara vya Zora na Eshitayoli.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ubukwe bwa Samusoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Umusi umwe, Samusoni amanuka i Timuna, abona umwigeme w’Umufilisitiya, aramwipfuza. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Agarutse i muhira, abwira se na nyina ati: “Nashimye umukobwa w’Umufilisitiya i Timuna, muramunsabira, nipfuza ko twubakana ambere umugore.”<verse eid="JDG 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Se na nyina bamwishura bati: “Mbega nta mukobwa n’umwe wo mu miryango ya Isirayeli yoshobora kuba umugore wawe, aho urongora uwo mu ntakebwa z’Abafilisitiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:3">Ariko Samusoni abarira se ati: “Genda umunsabire, kuko ni we numva nashimye.” <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Se na nyina ntibari bazi ko ivyo vyari bivuye k’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugira ngo haboneke akaryo ko kugwanya Abafilisitiya bari baganje Abisirayeli ico gihe.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Samusoni n’abavyeyi biwe bariko baramanuka bashika ku ruzabibu rw’i Timuna, intambwe itera Samusoni itontoma. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Ako kanya Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuzako n’ubushobozi bwinshi, aca ayitabaguza intoke nk’uko yotabagura umwagazi w’impene. Ariko ivyo ntiyigeze abibwira se na nyina. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Nuko Samusoni aramanuka i Timuna, avugana na wa mugore aca aramukunda cane.<verse eid="JDG 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Haheze igihe, ari mu nzira asubira i Timuna kugira ngo bagire ubugeni, akebereza gato hirya y’inzira kugira ngo arabe igikankara ca ya ntambwe, asanga cuzuyemwo inzuki nyinshi n’ubuki. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Aca abuhakuza amaboko agenda araburya. Ashikiriye abavyeyi biwe arabahako na bo bararya. Ariko ntiyigeze ababwira ko yabukuye mu magufa y’iyo ntambwe.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Mu gihe se wa Samusoni yari yagiye gutunganya ibisigaye ku bw’ubukwe, Samusoni yagize umusi mukuru i Timuna, nk’uko vyaba mu migenzo y’abasore. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Abavyeyi b’umugeni bamubonye, bamutoraniriza imisore mirongo itatu ngo ibe abagendanyi biwe.<verse eid="JDG 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samusoni arababwira ati: “Reka ndabahe igisokozo. Nimwashobora kumpa inyishu mu misi indwi tuzomara turi mu misi mikuru, nzobaha imitamana mirongo itatu yera cane, hamwe n’imyambaro y’impuzu mirongo itatu. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Ariko namwe nimutagitora muzompa imitamana mirongo itatu yera cane, hamwe n’imyambaro y’impuzu mirongo itatu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:13">Na bo baramubwira bati: “Tubwire ico gisokozo.”<verse eid="JDG 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Arababwira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">“Mu muryi havuyemwo ivyokurya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:14">mu munyenkomezi havuyemwo ibisosa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JDG 14:14">Inyuma y’imisi itatu ntibari bwaronke inyishu.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Ku musi ugira kane, babwira umugore wa Samusoni bati: “Hendahenda umugabo wawe agusigurire igisokozo yaduhaye, ahandi ho turaguturirana n’inzu ya so. Mwaduhamagariye ngaha kugira ngo mudusahure utwacu?”<verse eid="JDG 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Maze umugore wa Samusoni amugwako arira, avuga ati: “Urambesha ntunkunda, ahubwo uranyanka. Ni kubera iki ab’iwacu wabahaye igisokozo hanyuma ntiwambarira inyishu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:16">Na we aramwishura ati: “Na data na mama nta co nabasiguriye, wewe nari kukigusigurira kubera iki?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Wa mugore aca yama arira igihe cose yaba ari kumwe na Samusoni muri iyo misi mikuru. Ariko ku musi ugira indwi, Samusoni abarira umugore wiwe inyishu, kuko yama ariko aramuririra i ruhande. Na we aca aja kubwira iyo nyishu ba basore.<verse eid="JDG 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ku musi ugira indwi, imbere y’uko izuba rirenga, ba bantu baza aho Samusoni ari, bamubwira bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Mbega ni igiki gisosa gusumvya ubuki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">Ni igiki gikomeye gusumvya intambwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Samusoni arababwira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Iyo mutarimisha ishashi yanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 14:18">ntimwari kumenya igisokozo canje.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Maze Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuzako mu nkomezi nyinshi. Aca aja mu gisagara ca Ashikeloni, ahica abagabo mirongo itatu, abambura ivyabo, impuzu zabo aziha bamwe basigura ca gisokozo. Ariko Samusoni ababazwa cane n’ivyabaye, hanyuma asubira i muhira, abana na se na nyina. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Umugore wa Samusoni aca arongorwa n’umwe mu bagendaniye Samusoni mu misi mikuru yiwe.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s1">Samusoni yihora Abafilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Inyuma y’aho, hari mw’iyimbura ry’ingano, Samusoni afata umwagazi w’impene, awushira umugore wiwe nk’akaganuke. Avuga ati: “Ndagiye mu cumba c’umugore wanje turyamane.” Ariko se w’umukobwa aramwankira.<verse eid="JDG 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Amubwira ati: “Erega nagira ngo waramwanse. Ni co catumye ndamuha wa mugendanyi wawe wa mbere. Ariko ehe raba, murumunawe ni we mwiza kumurusha. Nabe ari we urongora.”<verse eid="JDG 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samusoni ababwira ati: “Ubu rero ndaronse imvo yo gukorera Abafilisitiya ico nshaka. Nzobagirira nabi.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Nuko aca arasohoka afata imbwebwe amajana atatu, azibohanya imirizo zibirizibiri, kuri iyo mirizo ibohanye akaja araboherako ibimuri. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Vya bimuri abidometse agaca azirungika mu mirima y’ingano y’Abafilisitiya. Aturira izo batekeye mu mikama hamwe n’izari zikiri mu mirima, aturira n’inzabibu hamwe n’imyelayo.<verse eid="JDG 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Abafilisitiya barabaza bati: “Ni nde yakoze ibi?” Bishura bati: “Ni Samusoni, umukwe w’umuntu w’i Timuna, kuko umugore wiwe yahawe umugendanyi wiwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:6">Nuko Abafilisitiya baca baraduga bafata wa mugore bamuturirana na se. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samusoni aca ababwira ati: “Ko mukoze ivyo, sinzogenda ntabihoye!” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Aca atera Abafilisitiya n’uburake bwinshi, yica benshi muri bo. Hanyuma aca amanuka mu bitandara vy’amabuye vy’i Etamu, abayo.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Abafilisitiya baca baraduga bashinga amahema yabo i Buyuda, amahema yabo yashika hafi y’igisagara ca Lehi. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Abantu b’i Buyuda barababaza bati: “Ni igiki gitumye muza kutugwanya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:10">Bishura bati: “Twaje gufata Samusoni tumugire imbohe, tumugirire nk’ivyo yatugiriye.”<verse eid="JDG 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Maze abantu ibihumbi bitatu bo mu Bayuda baca bamanuka kw’isenga ryo ku gitandara c’i Etamu, babwira Samusoni bati: “Mbega ntuzi ko Abafilisitiya ari bo batware bacu? Wabakoreye iki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:11">Abishura ati: “Nabakoreye ivyo na bo bankoreye.”<verse eid="JDG 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Na bo baramubwira bati: “Tuje kukuboha tugutange ku Bafilisitiya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:12">Samusoni arababwira ati: “Nimundahire ko mutanyica mwebwe nyene.”<verse eid="JDG 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Na bo bati: “Turakurahiye. Turakuboha gusa tugutange ku Bafilisitiya. Ntitukwica.” Baca bamubohesha ibiziriko bibiri bishasha, bamukura muri iryo senga. <verse eid="JDG 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Yegereye i Lehi, Abafilisitiya baca baza biha akamo k’intsinzi. Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> amuzako mu bushobozi bwinshi, acagagura vya biziriko nk’utunyuzi duhuye n’umuriro, birakoroka bimuva ku maboko. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samusoni aravye ku ruhande abona igufa ry’umubangabanga w’indogoba, araritora, aryicisha Abafilisitiya igihumbi.<verse eid="JDG 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Samusoni aravuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">“Umubangabanga w’indogoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">ndawurundishije ikirundo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">Umubangabanga w’indogoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 15:16">nawicishe abantu igihumbi.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Ahejeje kuvuga ivyo aca ashibura wa mubangabanga, aho hantu haca hitwa Ramati-Lehi risigura ngo “agasozi k’umubangabanga”.<verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Kubera yari anyotewe cane, arasemerera asaba <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: “Uhaye intsinzi ihambaye umusavyi wawe. None urandetse ngo nicwe n’inyota, ngwe mu maboko y’izi ntakebwa?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Maze Imana isatura ahantu hari ikinogo i Lehi, ituma haza amazi, Samusoni aranywa, asubira kugira inkomezi. Iryo riba rica ryitwa Eni-Hakore, bisigura “Iriba ry’Uwasemereye” kandi riracariho i Lehi gushika n’ubu.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samusoni yarongoye Abisirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri igihe bari bagitwarwa n’Abafilisitiya.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samusoni na Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Umusi umwe Samusoni aja i Gaza, ahura na maraya, aca aja kurarana na we. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Abantu b’i Gaza baramenya ko Samusoni ari ho ari, baca barakorana barara bamurindiririye ijoro ryose ku muryango w’igisagara bibwira bati: “Ejo nibwaca, tuzomwica.”<verse eid="JDG 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Ariko Samusoni wewe aryamayo gushika ijoro rigeze hagati gusa. Araheza aravyuka arandura umuryango w’ico gisagara, awurandurana n’ibihindizo hamwe n’ibizingiti vyawo. Avyiremeka ku rutugu, abidugana ku mutumba urabana na Heburoni.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Haheze imisi akunda umukobwa wo mu kiyaya ca Soreki, yitwa Delila. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Abatware b’Abafilisitiya baja kuraba Delila bamubwira bati: “Uzohendahende Samusoni akubwire aho akura inkomezi, akubwire n’ukuntu twomunesha kugira ngo tumubohe, tumumare amanyama. Umwe wese muri twebwe azoguha shekeli igihumbi n’ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 13.</char></note> z’ifeza.”<verse eid="JDG 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Nuko Delila abaza Samusoni ati: “Ndakwinginze umbarire aho ukura izo nkomezi hamwe n’ukuntu umuntu yokuboha akakumara amanyama.”<verse eid="JDG 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samusoni aramwishura ati: “Umuntu ambohesheje imigozi indwi ikiri mibisi, nca mba umunyantegenke nk’abandi bose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Nuko abatware b’Abafilisitiya bamuzanira imigozi indwi ikiri mibisi, arayimubohesha. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Yari yanyegeje abagabo mu cumba co haruguru c’iyo nzu, aca arasemerera ati: “Samusoni! Abafilisitiya baraje kugufata.” Samusoni aca avutagura ya migozi nk’uko inyuzi zicika zifashwe n’umuriro. Nuko inkomezi ziwe ntizamenyekana aho ziva.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Delila abwira Samusoni ati: “Ni kuki umpenda ukambwira ibinyoma? Mbwira neza rero ingene umuntu yokuboha akakugumya.”<verse eid="JDG 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Aramubwira ati: “Umuntu ambohesheje ibiziriko bishasha bitarakoreshwa, noca mba umunyantegenke nk’abandi bose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Nuko Delila aca afata ibiziriko bishasha arabimubohesha. Ba bantu bari binyegeje muri ca cumba nka kumwe kwa mbere. Delila aca arasemerera ati: “Samusoni! Ngaho Abafilisitiya baraje kugufata.” Samusoni acagagura vya biziriko nk’uwucagagura inyuzi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Delila aca abwira Samusoni ati: “Wahereye kera umpenda. Mbwira rero ingene umuntu yokuboha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:13">Samusoni aramubwira ati: “Ibitsibo indwi vy’umushatsi wanje ubifatanije n’igitambara c’impuzu, hanyuma ukabibohera ku giti noca mba umunyantegenke nk’abandi bose.” Nuko Delila ahengera Samusoni asinziriye, afata vya bitsibo indwi vy’umushatsi wiwe abifatanisha igitambara c’impuzu. <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Nuko arabijisha, abigumisha urumambo, aca asubira gusemerera ati: “Samusoni! Ngaho Abafilisitiya baraje kugufata!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:14">Aca arazanzamuka ava mw’itiro, ashingura rwa rumambo hamwe n’ikijishirwako impuzu.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Delila aravuga ati: “Uvuga gute ngo urankunda, udashobora kumbwira amabanga yawe? Ubu bubaye ubwa gatatu umpenda, utambwira aho ukura inkomezi zawe.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Maze akomeza kumuzigiriza uko bukeye uko bwije, gushika aho amubuza amahoro.<verse eid="JDG 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Ni ko kumubwira vyose ati: “Nta rwembe rurangera ku mutwe, kuko namye ndi Umunaziri w’Imana kuva nkivuka. Uwomwa uwu mushatsi, inkomezi zanje zose zoca zimvako, noca mba umunyantegenke nk’abandi bose.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Delila abonye ko amubwiye vyose, aca atuma intumwa kuri ba batware b’Abafilisitiya, ababwira ati: “Nimusubire mugaruke, kuko ubu yambwiye vyose.” Ba batware baca baragaruka bazanye na za feza mu minwe. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Nuko Delila amusinziririza ku bibero vyiwe, aca ahamagara umuntu amumwa vya bitsibo indwi vy’umushatsi wiwe, gutyo aba amuhinduye umunyantegenke. Inkomezi zica ziramuvako.<verse eid="JDG 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Aca aramuhamagara ati: “Samusoni, ngaho Abafilisitiya baraje kugufata!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:20">Aca arakanguka ava mw’itiro, yibwira ko abakira nk’ubwa mbere. Ariko ntiyari azi ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yamuretse.<verse eid="JDG 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Abafilisitiya baca baramufata, bamunogora amaso, bamumanukana i Gaza, bamubohesha umunyororo w’umwakaka, bamugira umusyi wo mw’ibohero. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Ariko umushatsi wiwe uca urasubira kumera inyuma yo kumumwa.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urupfu rwa Samusoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Umusi umwe abatware b’Abafilisitiya bakoranira hamwe ngo bashikanire ibimazi Dagoni imana yabo, bongere bagire umusi mukuru, kuko bagira bati: “Imana yacu yarekuriye Samusoni, umwansi wacu, mu maboko yacu.”<verse eid="JDG 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Abantu bose bamubonye bashima imana yabo bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 16:24">“Imana yacu ni yo yarekuriye umwansi wacu mu maboko yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 16:24">uwatikije imirima yacu, akica benshi muri twebwe.”<verse eid="JDG 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Mu gihe abo bantu basa n’ababorewe, baca bavuga bati: “Nimukure Samusoni mw’ibohero abe aradutwenza.” Nuko bahamagara Samusoni ava mw’ibohero ngo abe arabatwenza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 16:25">Nuko bamuhagarika hagati y’inkingi zibiri zari zifashe igisenge. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samusoni abwira uwari amufashe ukuboko ati: “Nshira aho nshobora kwumva inkingi zibiri zifashe iyi ngoro, kugira ngo ndazegamire.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Iyo nzu yari yuzuyemwo abagabo n’abagore, kandi n’abatware b’Abafilisitiya bose bari aho. Mu bibanza vyo hejuru hariyo abantu ibihumbi bitatu bariko bararaba ivyo Samusoni agira. <verse eid="JDG 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Maze Samusoni asenga <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga ati: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Nyeninganji, ndakwinginze unyibuke. Mana, ndakwinginze umpe inkomezi iri rimwe gusa, kugira ngo nihore Abafilisitiya ku maso yanje abiri.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Maze Samusoni aramvurira amaboko yiwe kuri za nkingi zibiri iyo nzu yari ihagazeko. Azisunikisha amaboko yose, <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />asenga ati: “Ndeka mpfane n’Abafilisitiya.” Asunika za nkingi n’inguvu nyinshi, iyo nzu isenyukira kuri ba batware n’abandi bose bari muri yo. Aho hantu yahiciye abantu baruta kure abo yishe mu yindi misi yose yabayeho.<verse eid="JDG 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Hanyuma abo bavukana hamwe n’umuryango wiwe wose baca baramanuka gutora ikiziga ciwe. Bamutahana iwabo, bamuhamba hagati y’i Zora n’i Eshitayoli, aho se wiwe Manowa yahambwe. Samusoni yatwaye Abisirayeli imyaka mirongo ibiri.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ibigirwamana vya Mika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Hariho umugabo yitwa Mika yava mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Umusi umwe abarira nyina wiwe ati: “Narumvise uvuma uwakwivye shekeli igihumbi n’ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 13.</char></note> z’ifeza. Ni jewe nazivye, ni jewe ndazifise.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:2">Nyina amwishura ati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aguhezagire, mwana wanje.”<verse eid="JDG 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Amugarukaniye za shekeli igihumbi n’ijana z’ifeza, nyina aca avuga ati: “Izi feza ndazeguriye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku bw’umuhungu wanje kugira ngo zikorwemwo igishushanyo n’ikigirwamana cometseko ifeza. Nzoheza ndabiguhe bibe ivyawe.”<verse eid="JDG 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika aca asubiza ya mahera nyina wiwe, na we aca akuramwo shekeli amajana abiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 2,3.</char></note> aziha umucuzi, na we azicuramwo igishushanyo n’ikigirwamana, baca babishira mu nzu kwa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Mika yari afise akazu asengeramwo, aca akoresha efodi n’ibindi bishushanyo, agena n’umuhungu wiwe ngo abe umuherezi wiwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Muri ico gihe Abisirayeli nta mwami bari bafise, umuntu wese yakora ibintu uko avyumva.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Umusi umwe haza umusore w’Umulewi avuye i Betelehemu i Buyuda, yabaye mu muryango wa Yuda, <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />ava i Betelehemu arondera aho yoba. Ari ku rugendo ni ho yashika kwa Mika, mu ntara y’imitumba mu gihugu ca Efurayimu.<verse eid="JDG 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Mika aramubaza ati: “Uva he?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 17:9">Aramwishura ati: “Ndi Umulewi w’i Betelehemu i Buyuda. Ndiko ndondera aho noba.”<verse eid="JDG 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Mika aramubwira ati: “Bana natwe, ube umuherezi wa data, nzoguhemba shekeli icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 115.</char></note> ku mwaka, ndakwambike nongere ndakugaburire.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Wa Mulewi aca aremera kubana na we, maze uwo musore aca aba nk’umwe mu bahungu biwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Mika agira uwo Mulewi umuherezi wiwe, aba mu nzu yiwe. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Mika aravuga ati: “Noneho menye ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobana nanje, ko ndonse umuherezi w’Umulewi.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abadani baja kuba i Layishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Muri ico gihe Abisirayeli nta mwami bari bafise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:1">Kandi muri ico gihe nyene, umuryango wa Dani wari ukiriko urironderera aho kuba, kuko batari bwaronke iragi ryabo mu miryango ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Nuko abo mu muryango wa Dani barungika abasoda batanu bava i Zora baja muri Eshitayoli gutata iyo ntara no kuyigenzura. Abo bantu baserukira umuryango wose wa Dani. Barababwira bati: “Genda mugenzure iyo ntara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:2">Ba bantu binjira mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu, bashika ku nzu kwa Mika, bararaho. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Begereje inzu ya Mika, bumvise ijwi rya wa muhungu w’Umulewi baramumenya. Baca binjirayo baramubaza bati: “Ni nde yakuzanye ino? Ukora iki aha hantu? Ni kubera iki uri ngaha?”<verse eid="JDG 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Aca ababwira ivyo Mika yamukoreye ati: “Mika yampaye akazi ko kumubera umuherezi.”<verse eid="JDG 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Baca bamubwira bati: “Turakwinginze utubarize Imana ko urugendo rwacu ruzogenda neza.”<verse eid="JDG 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Wa muherezi arabishura ati: “Nimugende amahoro, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azobana namwe mu rugendo rwanyu.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Ba bantu baca baragenda bashika i Layishi, aho hantu basanga abantu baho bibereye mu mahoro nk’Abanyesidoni, ata co binona, batekaniwe. Kandi kubera ko intara yabo ata co yari ikenye, bari bateye imbere. Baba kure cane y’Abanyesidoni, kandi nta migenderanire bari bafitaniye n’abandi bantu na bamwe.<verse eid="JDG 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Basubiye i Zora n’i Eshitayoli, benewabo barababaza bati: “Mwasanze ibintu vyifashe gute?”<verse eid="JDG 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Bishura bati: “Nimuze tugende tubatere! Twabonye ko intara yabo ari nziza cane. Mbega murindiriye iki? Ntimwijijanye imitima, ingo tugende kuhafata. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Nitwashikayo, muzohasanga abantu ata co binona, hamwe n’intara nini cane Imana yarekuriye mu maboko yanyu, intara ata kintu na kimwe ikenye.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Nuko abasoda amajana atandatu bo mu muryango wa Dani biteguriye intambara, bava i Zora n’i Eshitayoli. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Bari ku rugendo bashinga ikambi yabo ahitwa Kiriyati-Yeyarimu i Buyuda. Ni co gituma aho hantu hiswe Mahanehi Dani gushika n’ubu. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Bavuye aho baciye baja mu gihugu c’imitumba ca Efurayimu, bashika ku nzu kwa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Ba bantu batanu bari bagiye gutata iyo ntara ya Layishi babwira benewabo bati: “Mbe murazi ko muri izi nzu harimwo efodi, ibigirwamana vyo mu nzu, igishushanyo kibajwe hamwe n’ikindi c’igicurano? None tubigenze dute?” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Nuko baca barinjira mu nzu ya wa musore w’Umulewi kwa Mika, baramuramutsa. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Ba bantu amajana atandatu bari biteguriye urugamba basigara kw’irembo, <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />bamwe batanu bari bagiye gutata iyo ntara baba ari bo binjira, batwara ca gishushanyo c’ikibazano, efodi hamwe n’imana z’uwo muryango na ca gishushanyo c’igicurano, kandi wa muherezi na bamwe amajana atandatu bari bahagaze kw’irembo.<verse eid="JDG 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Wa muherezi abonye ba bantu binjiye mu kanyabugoro ka Mika bagatora ca gishushanyo, efodi, utugirwamana hamwe n’ikigirwamana gikozwe mu cuma, arababaza ati: “Ivyo mukora ni ibiki?”<verse eid="JDG 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Baramwishura bati: “Numa! Ntihagire ijambo na rimwe usubira kuvuga. Ingo ujane natwe utubere umuvyeyi n’umuherezi. Mbega si vyiza ko wobera umuherezi umuryango ukwiye wo mu Bisirayeli gusumba kumubera inzu y’umugabo umwe gusa?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Wa muherezi aca aranezerwa, cane. Ahitana efodi n’ibindi bishushanyo vyo mu muryango na ca gishushanyo c’ikibazano, aca ajana n’abo bantu. <verse eid="JDG 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Ashira imbere abana batobato, ibitungwa hamwe n’ayandi matungo yabo, barahindukira bafata urugendo.<verse eid="JDG 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Bageze kure gatoya yo kwa Mika, ababanyi ba Mika na bo barahamagarana, bakurikira abo mu muryango wa Dani. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Bagenda barasemerera inyuma ya bene Dani, na bo barahindukira babwira Mika bati: “Ni ibiki? Ni kubera iki wahamagaye abo bantu ngo baze kutugwanya?”<verse eid="JDG 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Mika arabishura ati: “Mwatwaye imana nakoze, mutwarana n’umuherezi wanje. Hari na kimwe mwansigiye? Ni kubera iki mumbaza muti ‘Ni ibiki?’ ”<verse eid="JDG 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Bene Dani baramubwira bati: “Ntiwirirwe uraharira rero, ahandi ho abakaza ishavu bari ngaha boraka bakakurandurana n’umuryango wawe.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Nuko bene Dani babandanya urugendo rwabo, Mika abonye ko bakomeye kumusumvya, aca arahindukira asubira i muhira.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Bene Dani baca bafata vya bigirwamana vya Mika hamwe n’umuherezi wiwe, barabandanya baja i Layishi, batera abantu bari bibereye mu mahoro ata co binona. Babaririkisha inkota, bongera baturira ico gisagara. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Nta muntu n’umwe bari bafise wo kubatabara kuko baba kure cane ya Sidoni kandi nta migenderanire bari bafitaniye n’abandi bantu na bamwe. Igisagara cari mu kiyaya hafi y’i Beti-Rehobu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 18:28">Bene Dani baca basanura ico gisagara baciberamwo. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Baca bacita Dani, izina rya sekuruza wabo, yavutse kuri Isirayeli, ariko ico gisagara cari cahoze citwa Layishi. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Bene Dani baca bashinga vya bigirwamana, Yonatani mwene Gerishomu, Gerishomu mwene Mose, n’abahungu biwe, baba abaherezi b’umuryango wa Dani ibihe vyose gushika igihe batwarwa nk’inyagano. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Babaho bakoresha ivyo bigirwamana Mika yari yarikoreye mu gihe ihema ry’Imana ryari i Shilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s1">Umulewi n’umuhabara wiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Muri ico gihe, Abisirayeli nta mwami bari bafise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 19:1">Hariho Umulewi yaba kure cane mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu. Umusi umwe akura umugore i Betelehemu h’i Buyuda amuzana i muhira nk’umugore wa kabiri. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Ariko uwo mugore ntiyemera kugumana na we, asubira iwabo kwa se i Betelehemu. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Haciye amezi ane, umugabo wiwe afata ingingo yo kuja kumugarukana. Agenda ajanye umukozi wiwe n’indogoba zibiri. Wa mugore aramwakira, amushikana mu nzu kwa se. Se amubonye amwakirana urweze. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Sebukwe aramugobera aguma ngaho gato, na we ahamara imisi itatu, asangira na bo, aryama ngaho.<verse eid="JDG 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Ku musi ugira kane bazinduka kare, baritegura ngo bagende, ariko sebukwe aramubwira ati: “Banza ufungure hanyuma muheze mugende.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Nuko bompi baricara, bararya, baranywa. Hanyuma se w’umukobwa amubwira ati: “Ndakwingize usubire urare, unezereze umutima wawe.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Wa mugabo asubira kwizindura ngo agende, sebukwe yongera kumugobera, asubira kuharara irindi joro. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Mu gatondo k’umusi ugira gatanu, azindutse kugira ngo agende, sebukwe aramubwira ati: “Akira imfungurwa ufungure, uraba uragenda n’inyuma y’umutaga.” Nuko bamara uwundi musi.<verse eid="JDG 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Wa mugabo n’umugore wiwe hamwe n’umukozi wiwe bahagurutse ngo batahe, sebukwe aramubwira ati: “Ehe raba bugira bwire; umusi usa n’uwurangiye, rara iri joro unezereze umutima wawe, hanyuma ejo uzozinduke witahira.” <verse eid="JDG 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Ariko kuko uwo mugabo atashaka gusubira kuharara irindi joro, aca afata inzira ija i Yebusi ari ho i Yerusalemu, ari kumwe n’umugore wiwe na za ndogoba zibiri ziriko amatandiko yazo.<verse eid="JDG 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Begereje i Yebusi, bwari bumaze kwira cane, wa mukozi abwira shebuja ati: “Ingo tuje mu gisagara c’Abayebusi dusabeho indaro.”<verse eid="JDG 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Shebuja aramubwira ati: “Oya ntibishoboka. Ntitwinjira mu gisagara c’abanyamahanga, kitabamwo Abisirayeli. Turabandanya dushike i Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Reka tubandanye turabe ko twoshika i Gibeya canke i Rama, turaza gusaba indaro muri ivyo bisagara.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Nuko barabandanya, izuba rirenga begereje i Gibeya mu ntara ya Benyamini. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Bajayo kugira ngo baharare. Baragenda bahagarara ku mbuga y’igisagara ariko ntihagira n’umwe abakira ngo abahe indaro.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Kuri uwo mugoroba, haza umutama ava mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu aba i Gibeya yari atashe avuye mu mirima. (Abantu baba ngaho bava mu umuryango wa Benyamini). <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Abonye izo ngenzi ziri ku mbuga y’igisagara, abaza ati: “Muva he, mukaja he?”<verse eid="JDG 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Wa mugabo arishura ati: “Tuvuye i Betelehemu h’i Buyuda tuja kure cane mu karere k’imisozi ya Efurayimu, ni ho mba. Nahora i Betelehemu h’i Buyuda, ubu nkaba ndiko nsubira i muhira ariko habuze n’umwe yompa indaro y’iri joro. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Turifitiye ivyokurya bikwiye vy’indogoba zacu n’ivyacu twebwe abasavyi bawe, jewe, uwu musavyikazi, n’uwu musore turi kumwe. Nta na kimwe dukeneye.”<verse eid="JDG 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Wa mutama arababwira ati: “Nimushike muhira iwanje, ndabaha ivyo mukeneye vyose. Nawe nu ntimworara ku mbuga.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Nuko arabashikana mu nzu, agaburira n’indogoba ziwe. Ahejeje kuboza ibirenge, baca barasangira ivyokurya.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Bakiriko baranezeranwa, abantu b’inkozi z’ibibi bo mu gisagara baraza bakikuza iyo nzu. Batangura guhondagura ku muryango bahamagara uwo mutama, bavuga bati: “Sohokana uwo mugabo aje kurara mu nzu yawe tumusambanye.”<verse eid="JDG 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Uwo mutama arasohoka ababwira ati: “Oya bagenzi banje, ndabinginze ntimukore ikibi kingana gityo. Uwu muntu ni umushitsi wanje, ntimukore igiterasoni nk’ico. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Ehe raba mfise umukobwa w’isugi, hari kandi n’umugore w’uwu mugabo. Reka ndababasohokanire mubakoze ico mushaka. Ariko uwo mugabo, ntimumukorere igiterasoni nk’ico.”<verse eid="JDG 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Ariko ba bantu ntibamwumviriza. Wa mugabo aca afata wa mugore wiwe amuterera hanze, bamukuranwako bamusambanya ijoro ryose, maze bugiye guca baramurekura. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Umutwenzi utamanzuye, wa mugore aca asubira ku nzu ya wa mutama, aho umugabo wiwe yari ari, ariko aca agwa imbere y’umuryango, agumaho gushika bukeye.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Mu gitondo, wa mugabo avyutse, yugurura umuryango, arasohoka ngo abandanye urugendo, asanga aho wa mugore yaguye imbere y’umuryango, afashe igishimaryango. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Aramubwira ati: “Haguruka tugende.” Ariko wa mugore ntiyamwishura. Wa mugabo aca amushira ku ndogoba, aramutahana.<verse eid="JDG 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Bashitse i muhira, wa mugabo aca afata imbugita, amucagaguramwo ibihimba icumi na bibiri, abirungika mu miryango icumi n’ibiri y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Abantu bose babibonye baravuga bati: “Ububi nk’ubu ntibwari bwakaboneke kuva Abisirayeli bavuye muri Egiputa. Nimuvyiyumvireko, muheze mutubwire ico twokora.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abisirayeli bahana Ababenyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Abisirayeli bose uhereye i Dani ugashika i Berisheba no mu ntara ya Gileyadi baza bafise umutima umwe, bakoranira i Misipa imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Harimwo n’abarongozi b’imiryango ya Isirayeli. Abasoda bari ibihumbi amajana ane bitwaje inkota. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Abo mu muryango wa Benyamini baramenya ko Abisirayeli baduze i Misipa. Abisirayeli bavuga bati: “Tubwire ingene iryo bara ryaguye.”<verse eid="JDG 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Wa Mulewi, ari we mugabo wa wa mugore yishwe, aca ababwira ati: “Twe n’umugore wanje twashitse i Gibeya muri bene Benyamini ngo turareho. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Mw’ijoro haza abagabo b’i Gibeya bakikuza inzu twarimwo, bagomba kunyica. Ni ko gufata umugore wanje bakamusambanya gushika apfe. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Naciye mfata umugore wanje, ndamucamwo ibice icumi na bibiri, ndabirungika mu ntara zose zahawe Isirayeli, kuko aba bantu bakoze icaha c’agahomerabunwa. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />None yemwe Bisirayeli, nimuvyiyumvire maze mugire ico mukoze.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Bose bahagurukira rimwe bahuje umutima n’inama, bavuga bati: “Nta n’umwe muri twebwe asubira i muhira. Nta n’umwe! <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Ahubwo Nguku uko tuja kugirira Gibeya: Reka tugire ubupfindo dutore abaja kuhatera. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Turatoranya ic’icumi c’abo mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli kugira ngo baje kuronderera ivyokurya ingabo. Abasoda bacu nibashika i Gibeya muri bene Benyamini, babakorere ibikwiranye n’ico caha giteye isoni bakoreye muri Isirayeli.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Nuko Abisirayeli bose bahuriza umutima n’inama hamwe ko baja gutera ico gisagara.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Imiryango ya Isirayeli irungika intumwa muri bene Benyamini bati: “Vyangenze gute ngo ivyaha vy’agahomerabunwa nk’ivyo bikorerwe muri mwebwe? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Nimuduhe izo nkozi z’ibibi z’i Gibeya kugira ngo tuzice, dukure ikibi muri Isirayeli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:13">Ariko bene Benyamini ntibumvira benewabo b’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Ahubwo bava mu bisagara vyabo, bakoranira i Gibeya ngo bagwanye Abisirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Bene Benyamini bakoranya abasoda ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitandatu bagwanisha inkota bavuye mu bisagara vyabo, biyongera ku bandi amajana indwi batoranijwe mu baba i Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Muri abo harimwo abasoda amajana indwi bari abanyebamfu, bashobora guteza ibuye umugozi, bagatumbereza umushatsi ntibawuhushe.<verse eid="JDG 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Ingabo zo mu Bisirayeli bandi, havuyemwo bene Benyamini, bari bafise abasoda ibihumbi amajana ane bagwanisha n’inkota, bamenyereye intambara.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Abisirayeli baca baduga i Beteli, babaza Imana bati: “Ni nde muri twebwe akwiye gutera bene Benyamini ubwa mbere?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:18">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abishura ati: “Yuda nabe ari we agenda imbere.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Bukeye Abisirayeli baravyuka bashinga amahema hafi y’i Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Abasoda ba Isirayeli baja kugwanya bene Benyamini, bashinga ibirindiro hafi y’i Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Abasoda bo muri bene Benyamini bavuye i Gibeya bica Abisirayeli ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bibiri uwo musi. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Ariko Abisirayeli barongera baterana intege, basubira ku birindiro vyabo, aho baheruka kugwanira. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Kuko Abisirayeli bari baduze i Beteli kuririra <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kugeza izuba rirenze, basaba Imana bavuga bati: “Dusubire tuduge gutera bene Benyamini benewacu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:23">Uhorago abishura ati: “Nimugende mubatere.”<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Abisirayeli barasubira begereza bene Benyamini umusi ugira kabiri. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Uwo musi na ho nyene bene Benyamini basohoka kubatangira, babicamwo abandi ibihumbi cumi n’umunani bazi kugwanisha inkota.<verse eid="JDG 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Maze Abisirayeli bose baca bongera kuduga i Beteli bicarayo, baririra imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> umusi wose, barisonzesha gushika rirenze, bashikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ibimazi bituriwe hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Abisirayeli barondera mu nyonga z’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Muri ico gihe Isandugu y’Isezerano y’Imana yari ikiri aho, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />na Finehasi mwene Eliyazeri, Eliyazeri mwene Aroni yari umuherezi. Barabaza bati: “Dusubire tuduge kugwanya Ababenyamini benewacu? Canke tureke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:28">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ababwira ati: “Nimugende kuko ejo nzobarekurira mu maboko yanyu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Maze Abisirayeli baragenda babunda inyuma y’i Gibeya bahakikuje. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Batera Ababenyamini umusi ugira gatatu, bagira ibirindiro nk’uko bari babigize ubwa mbere. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Ababenyamini barasohoka baza kubagwanya, barabirukana bava mu gisagara. Batangura kubica nk’ubwa mbere, Abisirayeli mirongo itatu bagwa mu gahinga no mu mabarabara aja i Beteli n’i Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Ababenyamini bakiriko baravuga bati: “Turabanesheje nk’ubwa mbere,” Abisirayeli na bo bariko baravuga bati: “Reka tumere nk’abahunga dusubira inyuma tubakwege bave mu gisagara baje mu mabarabara.”<verse eid="JDG 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Abisirayeli bose baca bava aho bari bari bagira ibirindiro i Bayali-Tamari, abari babibundiye na bo baca baratera ku ruhande rwo hirya rwa Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Abantu ibihumbi cumi bazi kugwana cane bavuye mu Bisirayeli bose baba ari bo baja imbere batera Gibeya. Urugamba rwari rukomeye cane, ariko Ababenyamini ntibari bwamenye amakuba abarindiriye. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aha Abisirayeli kunesha Ababenyamini, uwo musi Abisirayeli bica Ababenyamini ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu n’ijana bari bazi kugwanisha inkota. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Ababenyamini baca barabona ko baneshejwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Abisirayeli bari bigize nk’abahunze imbere y’Ababenyamini kuko bari bizigiye ko bamwe binyegeje baca baronka ingene batera i Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Maze abari binyegeje baca binjira ubwo nyene mu gisagara i Gibeya, baririkisha inkota ababayo bose. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Bari bumvikanye ko abo binyegeje bamaze kwinjira baca baturira ibintu vyinshi hakaduga umwotsi mwinshi mu kirere nk’ikimenyetso, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />hanyuma Abisirayeli babonye uwo mwotsi, bagaca batera Ababenyamini.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:39">Ababenyamini bari bamaze kwica Abisirayeli mirongo itatu, baca bibwira bati: “Turiko turabanesha nk’ubwa mbere.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Ariko wa mwotsi upfundutse uduga uva mu gisagara, Ababenyamini barahindukira babona umwotsi w’igisagara cose uduga kw’ijuru. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Abisirayeli baca barabahindukirira, Ababenyamini baca batekerwa n’ubwoba, kuko bari babonye ko uguhona kubashitseko. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Baca bahunga Abisirayeli baja mu bugaragwa, ariko ntivyakunda ko bahunga, kuko Abisirayeli bari mu gisagara baciye babatangira. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Nuko Abisirayeli bakikuza Ababenyamini, barabakurikira babafatira mu buseruko bwa Gibeya. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Abasoda ibihumbi cumi n’umunani bo muri bene Benyamini bamenyereye intambara bagwa muri iyo ntambara. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Bahindukiye ngo bahungire mu bugaragwa ku gitandara c’i Rimoni, Abisirayeli bicira ibihumbi bitanu mu nzira. Babandanya gusugereza bene Benyamini gushika i Gidomu, bica abandi ibihumbi bibiri.<verse eid="JDG 20:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Kuri uwo musi, abasoda ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu bo muri bene Benyamini bagwanisha inkota barishwe, kandi bose bari abahizi bakomeye. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Ariko amajana atandatu yo mu Babenyamini barashoboye guhungira mu bugaragwa ku gitandara c’i Rimoni, aho bamaze amezi ane. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Abisirayeli baca basubira mu bisagara vy’Ababenyamini baririkisha inkota ababibamwo bose, harimwo ibitungwa n’ikindi kintu cose bahasanze. Igisagara cabo cose bashikira baca bagiturira.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s1">Baronderera abagore Ababenyamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Igihe Abisirayeli bari bahuriye i Misipa bagira baje kugwanya Ababenyamini, bari barahiye bati: “Nta n’umwe wo muri twebwe azoshingira umukobwa wiwe Ababenyamini.”<verse eid="JDG 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Inyuma y’intambara n’Ababenyamini, abantu bose baca bahurira i Beteli, bicara imbere y’Imana gushika ku mugoroba, baborogana umubabaro mwinshi, <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />bavuga bati: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, Mana ya Isirayeli, ni kubera iki ibi vyashikiye Isirayeli, bituma umuryango umwe uzimangana muri Isirayeli?”<verse eid="JDG 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Bukeye mu gatondo ka kare, abantu bubaka igicaniro bashikana ibimazi bituriwe hamwe n’ibimazi vy’ishimwe.<verse eid="JDG 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Abisirayeli baca barabaza bati: “Ni nde wo mu miryango ya Isirayeli atari kumwe natwe i Misipa aho twakoranira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>?” Babajije gutyo kubera bari barahiriye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko uwutazokwifatanya na bo azokwicwa.<verse eid="JDG 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Maze Abisirayeli bagandarira benewabo ari bo Babenyamini, bavuga bati: “Uno musi umwe mu miryango ya Isirayeli wazimanganye. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />None abacitse kw’icumu tuzobakwera abagore gute ko twarahiriye imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ko ata mukobwa wacu tuzobashingira?” <verse eid="JDG 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Barabaza bati: “Nta muryango wo mu Bisirayeli utakoraniye hamwe natwe imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> i Misipa?” Basanga nta n’umwe w’i Yabeshi Gileyadi yaje muri iryo koraniro. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Kuko bamaze guharura abari bahari bose, basanze ata wo muri Yabeshi Gileyadi yari ngaho.<verse eid="JDG 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Ikoraniro rica rigena abasoda ibihumbi cumi na bibiri bamenyereye intambara, ngo baje i Yabeshi Gileyadi, bicishe inkota ababayo bose, harimwo abagore n’abana <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Bababwira bati: “Uku abe ari ko muzobagenza: muzotikize abagabo n’abahungu bose, hamwe n’abagore bose batakiri inkumi.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Baca basanga mu baba i Yabeshi Gileyadi harimwo inkumi amajana ane batararyamana n’abagabo, baca babatwara mw’ikambi i Shilo muri Kanani.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Ikoraniro ryose ry’Abisirayeli rica rirungika intumwa ku masigarira y’Ababenyamini bari ku gitandara c’i Rimoni kubabwira ko bashaka ko babana amahoro. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Nuko Ababenyamini basubira iwabo, bahabwa za nkumi z’i Yabeshi Gileyadi zari zazigurijwe. Ariko ntibabakwiye.<verse eid="JDG 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Abantu bose bagira umubabaro mwinshi ku bw’Ababenyamini kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yari yaciye igihengeri mu miryango ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="JDG 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Abari barongoye ikoraniro baravuga bati: “Mbega abagabo basigaye bo muri bene Benyamini tuzobaha abagore dukuye he ko abagore bose bo mu muryango wa Benyamini bapfuye?” <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Barongera bati: “Amasigarira yo mu muryango wa Benyamini ategerezwa kuronka abagore kugira ngo uwo muryango wa Isirayeli ntuzimangane ibihe vyose. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Ntidushobora kubaha abakobwa bacu kuko twarahiye tuti: ‘Azoba avumwe umuntu azoshingira umukobwa wiwe ku muntu wo mu muryango wa Benyamini.’ <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Baravugana bati: Ehe raba, hariho isabukuru y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uko umwaka uheze ibera i Shilo, mu buraruko bwa Beteli no hakuno y’inzira iva i Beteli ija i Shekemu, hamwe no mu bumanuko bwa Lebona.”<verse eid="JDG 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Baca babwira abo mu muryango wa Benyamini bati: “Muzogende mwinyegeze mu mizabibu, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />nimwabona abakobwa b’i Shilo bakoranye ngo batangure gutamba, muzoce muva mu mizabibu, umwe wese acakire umukobwa umwe amutware mu ntara ya Benyamini abe umugore wiwe. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Ba se babo canke basaza babo nibatwitwarako tuzobabwira tuti: ‘Nimutugirire ubuntu mubafashe, kuko tutashoboye kubaha abagore muri ya ntambara. Mwebwe nta co mwagirizwa kuko si mwebwe mwabashingiyeko abakobwa banyu.’ ”<verse eid="JDG 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Ababenyamini babikora uko babibwiwe. Mu gihe abakobwa bariko baratamba, umwe wese aca asumira umukobwa umwe aramutwara ngo abe umugore wiwe. Baca basubira mu ntara yabo, basubira kwubaka ibisagara, babibamwo.<verse eid="JDG 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Inyuma y’ivyo Abisirayeli baca basubira inyuma bamwebamwe bose mu miryango yabo, baja mu ntara zabo.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Muri ico gihe, Abisirayeli nta mwami bari bafise, umuntu wese yakora ibintu uko avyumva.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>